-sdk-7","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#init","content":"生成到 `<dir>/plugins/<名字>/`；`--lang` 决定模板："},"10":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-8","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#init","content":"| 语言     | 生成什么                                                                      |\n| ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `rust` | 独立 crate（`Cargo.toml` 开头有空 `[workspace]`）+ `src/lib.rs`（`define_plugin!`） |","table":"table-0"},"11":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-9","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#init","content":"| 语言          | 生成什么                                                 |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `c` / `cpp` | 源码 + `fuyubot_plugin.h`（从 `PLUGIN_HEADER` 落的盘，唯一权威源） |","table":"table-0"},"12":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-10","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#init","content":"| 语言       | 生成什么                                                                       |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `python` | `src/lib.rs`（`script_plugin!`）+ `plugin.py` + `fuyubot_plugin.py`(+`.pyi`) |","table":"table-0"},"13":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-11","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#init","content":"| 语言   | 生成什么                                                       |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `js` | `src/lib.rs` + `plugin.js` + `fuyubot_plugin.js`(+`.d.ts`) |","table":"table-0"},"14":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-12","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#init","content":"生成的 Rust 插件默认写 `fuyubot-plugin-api = \"0.1.0\"`（crates.io）。想对着 SDK 源码开发就设\n`FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH` 指向 SDK 仓库里放着 crate 的目录（`crates/`），生成器会改写成 `path = …`；\n没设且本地找不到源码时只写版本号。"},"15":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-13","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#codegen","content":"刷新某门语言的 ABI 绑定文件到 `<dir>`：C / C++ 是 `fuyubot_plugin.h`，Python 是\n`fuyubot_plugin.py` + `.pyi`，JS 是 `fuyubot_plugin.js` + `.d.ts`。**会覆盖同名文件**。\n所有语言都来自同一份权威源（`fuyubot_abi::PLUGIN_HEADER` 与 `fuyubot-sdk-script` 里的桥），\n不是手抄的第二份。`--lang rust` 没有可生成的绑定，命令会说明。"},"16":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-14","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#check","content":"**静态**读 PE / ELF / Mach-O 的导出表（用 `object`，**绝不 dlopen**——加载会在宿主进程里跑插件的\n初始化代码，那已经算「运行」了）。非零退出码 = 宿主会拒绝加载（缺 `plugin_init`，或根本不是动态库）。"},"17":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-15","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#check","content":"`check` 静态看不到 `PluginHandle.abi_version`——版本是 `plugin_init` 的**返回值**，不是静态符号。\n它只会如实报「宿主是 vN，插件的版本只能运行时判定」，**别把它当兼容性结论**。"},"18":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-16","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#abi-version--td-methods--td-method","content":"`td-methods` / `td-method` 吃的是**编译期**烤进二进制的真 `td_api.tl` 元数据（`TdApiSchema::compiled()`），\n不读文件、不联网。`--filter` 是子串匹配、忽略大小写；构造器不能当方法调，`td-method` 会明确拒绝。"},"19":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-17","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#abi-version--td-methods--td-method","content":"TDLib 的方法名 ≠ Telegram Bot API 的：所有发送都是 `sendMessage` + `input_message_content`，\n`sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` 之类在 TDLib 里不存在。写请求前先用 `td-method` 核一遍。"},"20":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-18","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#相关页面","content":"各语言怎么写：插件总览"},"21":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-19","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#相关页面","content":"装进插件目录：调试与安装"},"22":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-20","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#相关页面","content":"环境变量（`FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH`）：环境变量"},"23":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"page","content":"fuyubot 命令参考","breadcrumbs":["Docs","CLI 文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot"},"24":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-0","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","content":"运行时 CLI：init / run / status / stop / config / plugin"},"25":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-1","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"`init`"},"26":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-2","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"`run`"},"27":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-3","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#status--stop","content":"`status` / `stop`"},"28":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-4","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"`config`"},"29":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-5","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"`plugin`"},"30":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-6","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"相关页面"},"31":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-7","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","content":"跑框架的那个 CLI。它就是运行时包里的 `fuyubot(.exe)`（从源码跑时是 `target/{debug,release}/fuyubot`）。"},"32":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-8","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"| 参数      | 默认  | 说明                                              |\n| ------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `--dir` | `.` | 项目目录，生成 `<dir>/fuyubot.toml` 与 `<dir>/plugins/` |","table":"table-0"},"33":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-9","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"| 参数       | 默认        | 说明             |\n| -------- | --------- | -------------- |\n| `--name` | `fuyubot` | 只影响配置里的 `name` |","table":"table-0"},"34":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-10","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"| 参数         | 默认  | 说明                                          |\n| ---------- | --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `--api-id` | `0` | TDLib api_id（不是秘密，可以写进配置）；`0` = 没配，`run` 会问 |","table":"table-0"},"35":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-11","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"`init` **只写 `api_id`**：`api_hash` 是凭据，这个命令连参数都没有，配置里也没有这个字段。\n重复 `init` 会被挡住（不覆盖你改过的配置）。"},"36":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-12","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数         | 作用                                              |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `--config` | 配置文件，默认 `fuyubot.toml`（缺这个文件时 `run` 会按模板自动生成一份） |","table":"table-1"},"37":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-13","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数             | 作用                 |\n| -------------- | ------------------ |\n| `--plugin-dir` | 覆盖 `[plugins].dir` |","table":"table-1"},"38":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-14","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数           | 作用             |\n| ------------ | -------------- |\n| `--no-tdlib` | 不接 TDLib，只加载插件 |","table":"table-1"},"39":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-15","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数           | 作用                                        |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `--no-login` | 接 TDLib 但不走登录流程（已有 session 照样能用；CI / 容器用） |","table":"table-1"},"40":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-16","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数             | 作用                                                       |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--background` | 派生无终端的子进程，stdout/stderr 进 `logs/fuyubot.log`，父进程等状态发布后返回 |","table":"table-1"},"41":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-17","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数              | 作用                                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `--replay <文件>` | 把一批更新 JSON 灌进管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号** |","table":"table-1"},"42":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-18","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数                   | 作用                                      |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `--replay-wait <MS>` | 回放后等插件的静默窗口；不填按插件形态自选（脚本插件 2000，原生 150） |","table":"table-1"},"43":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-19","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"`run` 不带 `--replay` 的顺序：自动 init → 拿单实例锁 → 问/读凭据 → attach TDLib → 加载全部插件 →\n发 `setTdlibParameters` 并登录 → `getMe` 打印账户 → 发布状态 → 才开始分发。\n**登录这一步没有真账号端到端验过**，要立刻验插件就用 `--replay`。"},"44":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-20","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"后台运行**没有 stdin**：没有 session 又没有 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 时会直接失败并把日志尾巴打出来——\n先用前台登录一次（session 落在 `data/`）。"},"45":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-21","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#status--stop","content":"`status` 只读 `<项目根>/.fuyubot/`，三态：运行中 / 启动中 / 没有运行中的实例（顺带报「上次」的 pid）。\n`stop` 是**优雅**的：写 `.fuyubot/stop` 请实例自己收摊（停接收循环 → 卸载插件 → 停内核 → 放锁），\n8 秒不理会才硬杀。"},"46":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-22","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"打印**生效值**：默认值填好之后每一项到底是什么，外加「向上找到的那份 `fuyubot.toml`」。\n不加载插件、不接 TDLib、不建任何东西。"},"47":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-23","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"文件不存在时第一行会写「（不存在，下面全是默认值）」——`run` 就是这样起的，不骗人。"},"48":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-24","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"`account_type` 写错**不会**静默当 bot：那一行直接是 `⚠️ [telegram].account_type = \"robot\" 认不出来，只能写 \"bot\" 或 \"user\"`。"},"49":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-25","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"没有 `get` / `set` / `path`：改配置用编辑器更直接，路径 `status` 第一行已经打了。"},"50":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-26","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                     | 作用                    |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin list [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 列出插件；脚本插件会**展平到每个脚本** |","table":"table-2"},"51":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-27","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                                | 作用                              |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <文件或目录> [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 装一个插件：传**目录**是脚本插件，传**文件**是原生插件 |","table":"table-2"},"52":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-28","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                               | 作用                        |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <名字> [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 卸载：脚本插件按**目录名**，原生插件按动态库名 |","table":"table-2"},"53":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-29","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"**脚本插件**（推荐，见 脚本插件）：传的是**整个目录**\n（里面有 `pyproject.toml` / `package.json` 身份段），装到 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`。\n目标已存在会报错，要覆盖先 `uninstall` 再 `install`。"},"54":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-30","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"**原生插件**：传编好的 `.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`，或**工程目录**（去\n`<工程>/target/{release,debug}` 找产物）。产物连同旁边 / 工程根的 `.py` / `.js` /\n`.ts` / `.pyi` 同伴脚本一起拷进插件目录。workspace 成员的产物默认落在仓库根\n`target/` 下，这种情况加 `--target-dir` 或直接指着产物装。"},"55":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-31","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"`list` 会**真的加载一次**动态库才知道名字，但**只发现不启动**脚本——不装依赖、\n不起进程，随时可以跑。脚本的名字取自 manifest（`name` 字段），路径是入口文件。"},"56":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-32","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"`uninstall` 对**跑着的实例也安全**：文件删掉后目录 watch 会自动卸载对应脚本，\n不需要先 `stop`。"},"57":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-33","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"脚本插件上手：脚本插件"},"58":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-34","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"配置字段：配置文件"},"59":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-35","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"实例与后台运行：运行与实例管理"},"60":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-36","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"回放的输出与等待窗口：离线回放"},"61":{"id":"/docs/cli","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"page","content":"CLI 总览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","CLI 文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli"},"62":{"id":"/docs/cli-0","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"两个 CLI 的分工、共同约定与命令速查"},"63":{"id":"/docs/cli-1","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"共同约定"},"64":{"id":"/docs/cli-2","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"命令速查"},"65":{"id":"/docs/cli-3","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"fuyubot 有两个命令行程序，职责严格分离，**都不编译、不打包插件**——编译归插件作者自己的工具链\n（`cargo build`、`cl /LD`、`gcc -shared`）。"},"66":{"id":"/docs/cli-4","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"| CLI       | 干什么                                                          | 二进制             |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------- |\n| `fuyubot` | 跑框架：`init` / `run` / `status` / `stop` / `config` / `plugin` | `fuyubot(.exe)` |","table":"table-0"},"67":{"id":"/docs/cli-5","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"| CLI           | 干什么                                | 二进制                 |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-sdk` | 写插件：脚手架 / 生成绑定 / 查 TDLib 方法 / 静态检查 | `fuyubot-sdk(.exe)` |","table":"table-0"},"68":{"id":"/docs/cli-6","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"`fuyubot` 在运行时仓库的包里（旁边带着 `tdjson` 和内置插件目录 `plugins/`），`fuyubot-sdk` 在\nFuyuBot-SDK 的\n`fuyubot-sdk-<系统>-<架构>.zip` 里（不需要 `tdjson`）。从源码跑的等价写法是把子命令接在 `--` 之后："},"69":{"id":"/docs/cli-7","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项               | 约定                                                                   |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--config <文件>` | 默认 `fuyubot.toml`；项目根 = 配置文件所在目录，`plugins/`、`data/`、`.fuyubot/` 都相对它 |","table":"table-1"},"70":{"id":"/docs/cli-8","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项                   | 约定                     |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖配置里的 `[plugins].dir` |","table":"table-1"},"71":{"id":"/docs/cli-9","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项   | 约定                                             |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 退出码 | `0` 成功；非零是失败（`fuyubot-sdk check` 非零 = 宿主会拒绝加载） |","table":"table-1"},"72":{"id":"/docs/cli-10","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项   | 约定                                                                           |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 凭据  | **只走环境变量或交互式输入**，任何命令都不把它们写进文件（`TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH` / `TG_BOT_TOKEN`） |","table":"table-1"},"73":{"id":"/docs/cli-11","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项    | 约定                                             |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 输出语言 | 中文；`status` / `stop` 是给人看的，不要拿去解析（没有 `--json`） |","table":"table-1"},"74":{"id":"/docs/cli-12","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"<Card title=\"fuyubot 命令参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/fuyubot/\" />"},"75":{"id":"/docs/cli-13","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"<Card title=\"fuyubot-sdk 命令参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk/\" />"},"76":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"page","content":"架构与数据流","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture"},"77":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture","content":"一个宿主进程 + N 个动态库插件，以及它们之间的三段数据流"},"78":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"crate 依赖方向"},"79":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"启动顺序：先 attach TDLib，再 load 插件"},"80":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"主链路"},"81":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"注册作用域与卸载"},"82":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"两种插件形态"},"83":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"四大机制与内核"},"84":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"绑定层与运行时（`fuyubot-tdlib-sys` / `fuyubot-tdlib`）"},"85":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"`td_api.tl` 转成了什么（**只在编译期**）"},"86":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"关键类型对照"},"87":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture","content":"结论先说：**一个宿主进程 + N 个动态库插件（cdylib）**。插件不认识 Rust，只认识 `HostApiVTable`；\n宿主是**唯一**实现这张表的 crate（`fuyubot-loader`）。脚本插件（Python / JS / TS）不改变这个结构\n——目录形态由两个中间插件（`fuyubot_python_host` / `fuyubot_js_host`）托管，旧的胶水形态\n则把解释器子进程藏在自己的 cdylib 里。"},"88":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture","content":"本文只讲**结构与数据流**；构建、发布与排错见 开发文档。"},"89":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"箭头指向「依赖的那一边」（`A --> B` = A 依赖 B）："},"90":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                | 允许吗 |\n| -------------------------------- | --- |\n| `fuyubot-core` → `fuyubot-tdlib` | 禁止  |","table":"table-0"},"91":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                              | 允许吗 |\n| ------------------------------ | --- |\n| `fuyubot-abi` → `fuyubot-core` | 禁止  |","table":"table-0"},"92":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                                | 允许吗       |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | --------- |\n| `event` / `service` / `tool` / `middleware` 互相依赖 | 禁止（彼此不依赖） |","table":"table-0"},"93":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                   | 允许吗       |\n| ----------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot-tdlib-sys` → 任何 fuyu crate | 禁止（它是最底层） |","table":"table-0"},"94":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                                  | 允许吗         |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| `fuyubot-loader` → 四个机制 + `tdlib` + `abi` + `core` | 允许（**只有它**） |","table":"table-0"},"95":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"组合只发生在两处：`HostRuntime::new`（把四个机制 `install` 进 `Context`）与 `HostRuntime` 里的\n15 个 `unsafe extern \"C\"` 桥。四个机制 crate 绝不彼此调用。"},"96":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"为什么不能反过来：`attach_tdlib` 之前 `td_send` 走「没接 TDLib」分支（请求只留档 + 合成请求号，\n起点 `1 << 48`），而插件在 `plugin_start` 里就发请求（模板与示例都这样）；分发排在插件加载之后，\n否则插件漏订阅。`--replay` / `--no-tdlib` 故意不 attach——回放是离线验证。"},"97":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"`process`（吃 `&str`）只是 `process_value` 的前半段（解析 JSON 再交给它）；接收循环那条路\n本来就有 `Value`，所以走 `process_value`。"},"98":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"| 阶段                                                            | 数值            | 谁跑它                             |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `Stage::PreUpdate` / `PreRoute` / `InPlugin` / `PostResponse` | 0 / 1 / 2 / 3 | `UpdatePipeline::process_value` |","table":"table-1"},"99":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"| 阶段                                    | 数值    | 谁跑它                                          |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Stage::PreToolCall` / `PostToolCall` | 4 / 5 | **目前没有生产调用方**（只有 `fuyubot-middleware` 自己的测试） |","table":"table-1"},"100":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"六阶段的数值在 `fuyubot-abi::Stage`，与 `fuyubot-middleware::Stage` 一一对应，由 `runtime.rs` 的\n`stage_numbers_match_the_middleware_crate` 测试钉住。"},"101":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-24","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"三条容易搞错的语义："},"102":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-25","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**归属是「额外定向」，不是「排除广播」**：`emit` 发给所有订阅者，`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 是\n「全局 + 该归属」。响应因此对所有插件透明。"},"103":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-26","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**中间件一条更新跑一遍，不是每个监听器跑一遍**：`InPlugin` 的产出就是所有监听器看到的版本\n（按监听器各跑一遍的话，第 N 个会看到被改过 N 次的 payload）。"},"104":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-27","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**过滤器里的 `event_type` 键只用来选通道**，不参与负载匹配；等响应写\n`{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":N}`。"},"105":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-28","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"`HostRuntime::plugin_scope()` 给这次加载分配一个 owner id，之后所有跨 ABI 的注册\n（订阅 / 工具 / 服务 / 中间件）都记在这个 owner 名下（`RegistrationKind` + `Registration`）。\n`scope.commit()` 保留；提前 drop（init 失败、start 报错、ABI 不匹配）或 `LoadedPlugin` 被 drop 时，\n`rollback_owner(owner)` 一次性撤掉这批注册；宿主自己（owner 0）不受影响。"},"106":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-29","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"`LoadedPlugin` 的字段声明顺序就是卸载顺序：先 `plugin_stop`，再 `rollback_owner`，\n最后 `_lib: Library` 才 drop——到这一步动态库才真正卸载。"},"107":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-30","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"中间插件要批量托管脚本时，用**内置 scope 服务**（`get_service(\"fuyubot.host.scope\")`）开子作用域：\n`create` 出的子作用域从当前作用域栈继承 owner（脱离加载线程的场景——比如 watch 线程——要先建\nroot scope 再 `enter`，否则 owner 退化成宿主 0，卸载时回滚不到），注册落在子作用域里，\n`rollback_scope` 可以只撤这一批；插件卸载时连 owner 一起收。"},"108":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-31","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"**唯一的例外是 Go 的 c-shared 库**：它的运行时有线程与信号处理器，卸载后进程会 access violation\n（`0xC0000005`，而且崩在退出那一刻）。`PluginLoader` 用文件里的 Go buildinfo 魔数认出 Go 产物，\n对这类库 `plugin_stop` 与注册回滚照跑，但**故意不卸载那个 `Library`**，让它映射到进程退出。\n代价是「同一进程内反复加载同一个 Go 插件」不可靠（热重载路径），收益是 Go 插件能正常用。"},"109":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-32","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|         | 动态库插件             | 脚本插件（目录形态）    |\n| ------- | ----------------- | ------------- |\n| 进程 / 边界 | 与宿主同进程；C ABI 函数调用 | 一进程一脚本；经原生桥回调 |","table":"table-2"},"110":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-33","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|      | 动态库插件 | 脚本插件（目录形态）                                   |\n| ---- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本定位 | 不适用   | manifest（`[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"`）声明入口 |","table":"table-2"},"111":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-34","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|     | 动态库插件                 | 脚本插件（目录形态）                                 |\n| --- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 装载  | `plugin install <产物>` | `plugin install <目录>` → `plugins/scripts/` |","table":"table-2"},"112":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-35","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|           | 动态库插件     | 脚本插件（目录形态）                    |\n| --------- | --------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 启动时序 / 崩溃 | 同步；崩了拖垮宿主 | 装依赖后起进程，等 `ready`；子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-2"},"113":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-36","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|       | 动态库插件                                  | 脚本插件（目录形态）           |\n| ----- | -------------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| 已知天花板 | panic 靠 `C-unwind` + `catch_unwind` 接住 | 改代码不热载（watch 只认目录增删） |","table":"table-2"},"114":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-37","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本侧（薄 SDK 与目录形态）见文档站的\n脚本插件。\n两门语言的中间插件是同一套机制的两份实现，所以「Python SDK 与 JS SDK 对 ABI 的理解」不可能漂移。"},"115":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-38","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"共用的三条约定：**回调错误类型由 core 定**（四个 crate 不能互相依赖，所以 `fuyubot_core::Result<T>`\n是全仓唯一允许 boxed error 的地方）；**与 Context 的集成 = `install(ctx)` + 扩展 trait**\n（返回的 `Effect` 要一直持有，否则服务立刻从 Context 消失）；**所有注册都返回句柄且 `#[must_use]`**\n（四个 Handle 内部都包着 `core::Effect`，drop 即回滚）。"},"116":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-39","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**事件**：`emit` 在锁**外面**调回调，所以回调里再 `on` / `emit` / `off` 不会自锁；某个回调返回\n`Err` 会**中断**本次广播并把错误抛出去。`Filter` 用点分路径（`\"message.chat.id\"`）做字段相等匹配。"},"117":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-40","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**服务**：命名容器（跨语言插件报不出 Rust 的 `TypeId`）。同名重复注册报错；`get::<T>` 类型不匹配\n返回 `None`，用 `contains` + `type_of` 区分「没注册」和「类型不对」。"},"118":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-41","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**工具**：`call_tool` = 查表 → 权限门 → input_schema → 处理器 → output_schema。\n`handler: Option<ToolHandlerFn>`，`None` 表示「只有元数据的声明型工具」；注册/注销用 `on_change`\n广播（**不认识事件系统**，要不要转成事件总线由宿主层做）。"},"119":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-42","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**中间件**：洋葱模型，`next.run(ctx)` 前是进入段、后是退出段。`run(stage, ctx)` 会**先复制层列表\n再执行**，所以中间件里再 `use_middleware` 不会自锁；不调 `next.run` 就是不往下走。"},"120":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-43","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"内核几条语义：**`Context` 只有 `&self`**（`provide` 返回 `Effect`，drop 即注销，必须持有）；\n**`Effect::merge` 是 LIFO**（`a.merge(b)` 撤销顺序 `b → a`）；**加载顺序由依赖决定，卸载是加载顺序\n的倒序**（`load_all` 报错会把本次已加载的卸掉，不留半加载）；**有依赖者时 `unload` 拒绝**\n（`HasDependents`，不级联）；`reload` 能工作是因为管理器存的是 `Arc<dyn Plugin>` 而不是 `Box`。"},"121":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-44","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"`fuyubot_tdlib::` 根上重导出 sys 的 `ffi` / `schema` / `td_api` / `tl_schema` 模块与 `TdApiSchema` /\n`EntryKind` / `TlEntry` / `TlParam` / `SchemaError` / `TdApi` / `DEFAULT_LOG_VERBOSITY`——**既有调用方的\n路径全部不变**。`src/build_support.rs` 与 `src/loader/vendored.rs` 都被**两边共用**（各自的 build.rs 用\n`#[path]` 引同一份源码），所以它们只能依赖 std 与可选依赖；`[package.metadata.fuyubot]` 有两份，值必须\n一致（守卫测试 `metadata_is_in_sync_between_the_two_crates`）。"},"122":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-45","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"运行时加载优先级（`loader::resolve`）：`TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` 文件/目录 → **vendored 目录 →\n可执行文件所在目录（ExeDir）** → Linux 带版本号系统库 → 裸库名（真去 dlopen 试一次）；全失败返回\n`TdlibLoadError::NotFound`，消息里逐条列出 `[1]`…`[4]` 的尝试与原因。真正加载走\n`loader::open_library`（Windows 绝对路径走 `LOAD_WITH_ALTERED_SEARCH_PATH`），**不是 `Library::new`**\n——新增任何加载动态库的地方都走它。`@extra` 是**字符串**（`RequestId::to_extra()`），`route()`\n遇到非数字 `@extra` 会退化成更新而不是 panic。"},"123":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-46","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"两份产物来自同一个解析结果，而且 `tl_schema.rs` 被 build.rs 用 `#[path]` 引同一份实现，所以「编译期\n写出来的形状」与「运行时读回去的形状」不可能漂移。生成规则：类 → 带 `#[serde(tag = \"@type\")]` 的 enum；\n函数 → 带 `METHOD` / `RESULT` 常量的 struct（派生 `Default`，没填的字段不写进请求）；类字段一律\n`Option<Box<T>>`（断互递归 + 对上「缺字段就是没有」）；认不出的类型降级成 `serde_json::Value`；Rust\n关键字转义（`r#type`）；**文档四级齐全**（类 / 变体 / 函数 / 字段）。归类只认\n`---functions---` / `---types---` 分区标记，认不出来时**构建直接失败**。\n`check_request` 那套元数据仍然保留——它做的是生成类型做不到的本地校验（生成类型只能保证**结构**对，\n挡不住「用错方法名」）。"},"124":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-47","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                                      | 位置            | 作用                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable` / `PluginHandle` / `HostApi` | `fuyubot-abi` | 函数表（18 字段） / `plugin_init` 的返回值（`abi_version == 0` = 失败） / 插件侧门面 |","table":"table-3"},"125":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-48","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                                                            | 位置               | 作用                                                                       |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `HostRuntime` / `UpdatePipeline` / `PluginLoader` / `LoadedPlugin` | `fuyubot-loader` | 15 个桥的落点、请求留档、响应回投、`rollback_owner`；六阶段（实跑 4 个）+ 双通道路由；dlopen 与 drop 即卸载 |","table":"table-3"},"126":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-49","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                               | 位置              | 作用                                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `TdClient` / `Routed` / `ReceiveLoop` | `fuyubot-tdlib` | TDLib 客户端；`route()` 分出 `Update` / `Response`；停止把手（`stop()` / `join()`，drop **不会**停） |","table":"table-3"},"127":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-50","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                    | 位置                 | 作用                                                                                                    |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify` / `RichMessage` | `fuyubot-simplify` | 发消息 / 相册 / 编辑 / 删除 / Markdown 转 entities / 等响应 / **富消息**（`rich` 模块，本地 Markdown → 块树）；参数是**每个方法一个结构体** |","table":"table-3"},"128":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-51","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                   | 位置                  | 作用                                     |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `TdApiSchema::compiled()` | `fuyubot-tdlib-sys` | 编译期烘焙的元数据；`check_request` 做本地方法名/参数名校验 |","table":"table-3"},"129":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"page","content":"构建与测试","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test"},"130":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test","content":"三条硬门槛、两类测试，以及本机的离线约定"},"131":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"三条硬门槛"},"132":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"构建输入与缓存"},"133":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"两类测试"},"134":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"测试写法的三条规矩"},"135":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#本机的离线约定","content":"本机的离线约定"},"136":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"⚠️ 三条都带 `--workspace`：根 `Cargo.toml` 有 `default-members = [\"crates/*\"]`，\n**裸** `cargo build` / `cargo test` 只编 `crates/`，不编 `examples/`。\n`#[allow]` 不算消 warning——能改就改。"},"137":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"`cargo tree --workspace --offline` 必须无环；依赖方向随时能用\n`cargo tree -p <crate> -e normal --depth 1` 验。"},"138":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**，`fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs` 无条件去拿它："},"139":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"缓存根按顺序找（`build_support::cache_roots()`，两个 build.rs 共用同一串）："},"140":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已把第三档指好（`relative = true`，相对仓库根），克隆下来直接能用。"},"141":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"**手写必须绝对路径**：两个 build.rs 的 CWD 是各自的 crate 根，相对路径会解析到 crate 下面然后 404。"},"142":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`$OUT_DIR` 每次重跑构建脚本都会被清空 → 退到它意味着下次**重新下载**，缓存根全写不进去时会明确警告。"},"143":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"转换在编译期完成：日志里只有一条 `已转换 …\\td_api.tl：共 N 条`。条数取决于那份文件，**别当常量写进断言**。"},"144":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`.cargo/config.toml` 另有三个别名：`cargo bot`（= `fuyubot run`）、`cargo package-bot`、\n`cargo package-sdk`（release 构建，产物在 `target/release/`，tdjson 由 build.rs 放到 exe 同级）。"},"145":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"**默认自检不碰任何外部文件**：真 tdjson、真 `td_api.tl`（用 `TDLIB_TD_API_TL` 顶替时）、真 Releases 下载\n全部藏在 `#[ignore]` 后面。所以「全绿」只证明代码自洽——**与真实 TDLib 对不对得上只有那些\n`--ignored` 能回答**："},"146":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"改 `ffi.rs` 的符号名/arity、`loader::open_library`（或任何加载动态库的地方）、\n`tl_schema` / `tl_codegen`，或碰登录/授权代码之后，**必须**跑一次。\n`--features vendored` 那条（会尝试访问 Releases，失败只警告）在动 build 脚本 / 资产表时也要跑。"},"147":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"**临时目录不许用 `%TEMP%`**：一律 `target/test-tmp/<crate>/<名字>`。MSYS 会把 `TEMP` 改成 `/tmp`，\n受限环境里真实 `%TEMP%` 也可能写不了——换个 shell 就红的测试几乎总是这个原因。"},"148":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"**嵌套调用 cargo / 编译器时**，把子进程的 `TEMP`/`TMP` 也指到那里：MSVC 的 `link.exe`\n建不了 `%TEMP%` 里的 `lnk*.tmp`，直接 `LNK1104`，插件/夹具根本编不出来。"},"149":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"非平凡逻辑留**一个**可运行自检：`#[cfg(test)]` 里一个 `assert` 测试即可，不引测试框架。"},"150":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#本机的离线约定","content":"DSH 沙箱里 cargo 的 TLS 连不上 crates.io（`schannel … SEC_E_NO_CREDENTIALS`）。\n`Cargo.lock` 已落盘，`--offline` 就够；**只有改依赖版本时**才需要联网，那时向用户申请一次完整权限跑\n`cargo fetch`。"},"151":{"id":"/docs/dev","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"page","content":"开发文档","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev"},"152":{"id":"/docs/dev-0","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"改框架本身：结构、构建测试、踩过的坑、发布"},"153":{"id":"/docs/dev-1","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"本节的页面"},"154":{"id":"/docs/dev-2","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev#一分钟上手","content":"一分钟上手"},"155":{"id":"/docs/dev-3","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"这一节是给**改 fuyubot 仓库**的人看的，不是给用它写 bot 的人看的。"},"156":{"id":"/docs/dev-4","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"**公开文档都在这个文档站**：结构、ABI、插件写法、使用方式。"},"157":{"id":"/docs/dev-5","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么    | 在哪     |\n| ------ | ------ |\n| 结构与数据流 | 架构与数据流 |","table":"table-0"},"158":{"id":"/docs/dev-6","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么      | 在哪   |\n| -------- | ---- |\n| 构建、测试、发布 | 下面三页 |","table":"table-0"},"159":{"id":"/docs/dev-7","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么                       | 在哪                                    |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 当前状态 / 构建契约 / 已知缺口 / 踩过的坑 | 仓库里随源码分发的工程台账（`docs/`，不入库，只给改代码的人接力用） |","table":"table-0"},"160":{"id":"/docs/dev-8","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"仓库有一条硬规矩：**文档里出现的命令必须真跑过**，带输出的示例要抄真实输出。\n改行为就同步改文档：文档站给使用者与插件作者，仓库里的工程台账给下一个改代码的人。\n否则下一个人会比你更相信旧文档。"},"161":{"id":"/docs/dev-9","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"架构与数据流\" href=\"/docs/dev/architecture/\" />"},"162":{"id":"/docs/dev-10","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"构建与测试\" href=\"/docs/dev/build-test/\" />"},"163":{"id":"/docs/dev-11","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"常见陷阱\" href=\"/docs/dev/pitfalls/\" />"},"164":{"id":"/docs/dev-12","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"发布\" href=\"/docs/dev/release/\" />"},"165":{"id":"/docs/dev-13","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#一分钟上手","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**：`TDLIB_TD_API_TL` → 缓存 → 从 Releases 下载，拿不到就让构建失败。\n仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已经把缓存指到 `.tdlib-cache/`（相对仓库根），所以上面三条直接敲就行。"},"166":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"page","content":"常见陷阱","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls"},"167":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","content":"编号即引用锚：这些坑真踩过，别再踩回去"},"168":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"ABI 与回调"},"169":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"事件语义"},"170":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"TDLib"},"171":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"Rust / Windows"},"172":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","content":"每条都**真踩过**。这里挑最容易复发的几类；仓库内部的台账编号是跨文件引用锚，只随源码分发，不在这里展开。"},"173":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**`extern \"C\"` 边界逃出去的 panic 直接 abort**，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind`：插件与中间件回调必须是\n`unsafe extern \"C-unwind\"`，`define_plugin!` 自己也要包一层。"},"174":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**一个 crate 只能展开一次 `define_plugin!`**：四个导出符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次必然重复定义。"},"175":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**订阅句柄必须活着**：每轮循环里 `let _h = …` 就是每轮退订；`for` 里注册要把句柄收进循环外的 `Vec`。"},"176":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**`Effect` / `Subscription` 是 `#[must_use]`**：`let _ =` 会立刻回滚；`drop` 就是注销。"},"177":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"**归属（scope）不是「排除广播」**：第一版写成「全局 `emit` 只发 scope 0」，插件永远收不到更新。\n正确语义是「`emit` 发给所有人；`emit_scoped(scope)` 额外定向给该归属」。"},"178":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"**过滤器里的 `event_type` 键只选通道**，不参与负载匹配。"},"179":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**方法名/字段路径按 TDLib 来，不按 Bot API**：只有 `sendMessage` + `input_message_content`；\n`updateFile` 的 file id 在 `file.id` 不是顶层 `file_id`；`user` 没有 `is_bot` / `username`。"},"180":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**`td_api.tl` 的「函数 vs 构造器」只认 `---functions---` / `---types---` 标记**：\n`updateNewMessage … = Update` 是构造器，任何按首字母大写的启发式都会误判。"},"181":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**写死 TDLib 方法名/参数名的模块必须留一条 `check_request` 测试**（离线就能红）。"},"182":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**`Context` 的固有方法会遮蔽扩展 trait 的同名方法**：命名服务只能叫 `provide_named` / `resolve`。"},"183":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**thiserror 把名为 `source` 的字段当错误链**：存额外文本的字段叫 `detail`。"},"184":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**Windows 文件锁是强制锁**：锁住的字节范围别人 `read` 会 `ERROR_LOCK_VIOLATION`，\n所以实例状态把「锁」与「内容」分成两个文件（`.fuyubot/lock` 与 `.fuyubot/status`）。"},"185":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**PowerShell 的 `Get-Content` 在本机按 cp936 解码 UTF-8**：中文注释会毁，还会吞换行导致行号错位。\n改源码一律用编辑器工具，shell 只用来跑命令。"},"186":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**`tar` 在 Windows runner 上要 POSIX 路径**（`/d/a/…`）：GNU tar 会把 `D:/…` 当成「连主机 D」。"},"187":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"> 新踩的坑要补进仓库的 `docs/pitfalls.md` 台账（随源码分发）并给新编号——编号是跨文件引用锚。"},"188":{"id":"/docs/dev/release","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"page","content":"发布","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release"},"189":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"两套发布资产（TDLib 库 / fuyubot 本体）与文档站的静态部署"},"190":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"TDLib 资产（构建期契约）"},"191":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"fuyubot 本体（用户下载即用）"},"192":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"文档站"},"193":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"仓库有两套**互不替代**的发布资产，tag 前缀不同，别混："},"194":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"| 资产                            | tag           | 生产方                                        | 谁消费                             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| TDLib 动态库 `TDLib-<os>-<arch>` | `TDLib-v<版本>` | `build-tdlib.yml` + `.github/scripts/*.sh` | 构建期（`fuyubot-tdlib` 的 loader 表） |","table":"table-0"},"195":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"| 资产                                      | tag     | 生产方               | 谁消费         |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------- | ----------------- | ----------- |\n| fuyubot 本体 `fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip` | `v<版本>` | `release-bot.yml` | 终端用户下载、解压即跑 |","table":"table-0"},"196":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"消费方是 `crates/fuyubot-tdlib/src/loader/vendored.rs` 的 `ASSETS` 表，生产方是\n`.github/workflows/build-tdlib.yml` 的 matrix；`tests/release_assets.rs` 会**读 workflow 双向比对**，\n漂了就红。四条硬要求："},"197":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"tag 必须精确是 **`TDLib-v<版本>`**（下载 URL 由 `release_url()` 拼）；"},"198":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"资产名**精确等于** `ASSETS` 表的值，**不带扩展名**，`<os>-<arch>` 用 cargo 口径（`x86_64` / `aarch64`）；"},"199":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"内容必须是 **`.tar.gz`**（`.zip` 会被 `extract_library` 当裸库原样写出，得到坏文件还不报错）；"},"200":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"**加平台只动 `ASSETS` 表 + CI matrix，两边同时加**（`macos/x86_64` 故意不在表里：没有那个 runner）。"},"201":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"运行时仓库的 `release-bot.yml` 在 `v*` tag（或手动 dispatch）上按平台编 `fuyubot-cli` 与三个内置插件，\n**构建阶段就把最终布局组好**（`plugins/` 直接填内置插件，不单独打包），每平台出一份中间\n`.tar.gz`（已是最终布局）；`publish`（Linux runner）把它转成用户下载的 zip 再挂 Release："},"202":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"**资产名**：`fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`，例 `fuyubot-v0.1.0-windows-x86_64.zip`。\n`<版本>` 取自 tag（分支上手动构建退回 `dev-<sha7>`）；`<OS>` = windows / linux / macos，\n`<平台>` = x86_64 / aarch64。名字里带版本，同一页 Release 里多个构建可以并存、一眼可辨。"},"203":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"**zip 解压出来就是本体**——不再套一层目录："},"204":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"`fuyubot-sdk-<os>-<arch>.zip` 由 **SDK 仓库**（`FuyuBot-SDK` 的 `release-sdk.yml`）发布，\n不混进运行时的包。"},"205":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"平台集合与 `ASSETS` 表一致：Windows / Linux 各 x86_64 + aarch64，**macOS 只有 aarch64**。"},"206":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"中间产物（每平台一份 `fuyubot-*.tar.gz`）只留在 Actions artifacts 里，**不挂 Release**——\n它是构建产物，不是发布形态。"},"207":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"三条契约：**资产名 `fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`**、**zip 解压即本体**（无套层目录）、\n**`tdjson` 与可执行文件同级**（靠 loader 优先级 2「可执行文件所在目录」命中）。\nzip 只在 `publish`（Linux runner）里生成，Windows runner 的 bash 没有 `zip` 命令。"},"208":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"GitHub Actions 在本机验不了。改 workflow 的组包步骤时，把 `Package the runtime` 与\n`Turn each bundle into a flat zip` 两段 bash **原样抠出来在本机跑一次**，\n解压产物验证 `--version` / `init` / `run --replay` / `--no-login --background` 全通——\n这一步是踩过「改了却没验」之后定的规矩。"},"209":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"本站是静态导出（`output: 'export'`），产物 `out/`："},"210":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"**push `main` 自动构建并发布到 `gh-pages`**（`pages.yml`；Pages 的 source 是 `gh-pages` 分支）。\nGitHub Pages 是项目页（挂在 `/FuyuBot-docs/` 下）：构建前设 `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=/FuyuBot-docs`，\n正式域名在**构建前**设 `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`（绝对 URL 是烘进产物的）；\n`public/.nojekyll` 不能少（`_next/` 以 `_` 开头会被 Jekyll 吞掉）。"},"211":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"发布前过一遍提交检查清单：文档站与运行时仓库里的工程台账都更新、`cargo build/test/fmt` 三条绿、\n没把凭据写进任何文件。"},"212":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"fuyubot 文档","tags":[],"url":"/docs"},"213":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"基于 TDLib 的 Telegram bot / user 框架"},"214":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"两个 CLI，职责严格分离"},"215":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"现在能验证到什么程度"},"216":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#下一步","content":"下一步"},"217":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"**fuyubot** 是一个基于 TDLib 的 Telegram bot / user 框架：Rust 内核 + C ABI 插件 + 多语言 SDK。\n插件就是一个动态库（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`），一个 cdylib 就是一个插件。"},"218":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"使用文档\" href=\"/docs/usage/\" description=\"下载安装、配置文件、运行、回放、实例管理与排错\" />"},"219":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"插件开发\" href=\"/docs/plugin/\" description=\"Rust / C / C++ / Python / JS / TS 插件、事件、TDLib 调用与 ABI\" />"},"220":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"开发文档\" href=\"/docs/dev/\" description=\"改框架本身：架构、构建测试、常见陷阱、发布\" />"},"221":{"id":"/docs-8","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"CLI 文档\" href=\"/docs/cli/\" description=\"fuyubot 与 fuyubot-sdk 的完整命令参考\" />"},"222":{"id":"/docs-9","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"| CLI       | 干什么 | 子命令                                           |\n| --------- | --- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot` | 跑框架 | `init` / `run` / `status` / `stop` / `plugin` |","table":"table-0"},"223":{"id":"/docs-10","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"| CLI           | 干什么 | 子命令                                                                       |\n| ------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-sdk` | 写插件 | `init` / `codegen` / `check` / `abi-version` / `td-methods` / `td-method` |","table":"table-0"},"224":{"id":"/docs-11","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"两个都**不编译、不打包插件**——编译是插件作者用自己语言工具链（`cargo build`、`cl /LD`、`gcc -shared`）完成的事，\n`fuyubot plugin install` 只负责把编好的产物**复制**进插件目录。"},"225":{"id":"/docs-12","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"离线回放（`--replay`）与实例三件套（单实例锁 / 后台运行 / `status` / `stop`）是端到端跑过的。\n真实账号登录 `run` 会接上 TDLib 走授权状态机，但**没有拿真账号端到端验过**「收真更新 → 插件回一条」。"},"226":{"id":"/docs-13","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"内核、插件 ABI、加载器、更新管线、四大机制：有测试，全绿"},"227":{"id":"/docs-14","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"真 TDLib（真 `tdjson` + 真 `td_api.tl`）：`getMe` 往返、同步 `execute`、插件调 TDLib 收响应，都在 `-- --ignored` 自检里验过"},"228":{"id":"/docs-15","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"`td_api.tl` 在**编译期**被转成元数据烤进二进制，运行时不读文件、不解析"},"229":{"id":"/docs-16","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"`tdjson` **运行时动态加载**，构建期会把它拷到可执行文件同级目录"},"230":{"id":"/docs-17","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"**普通用户**：到 Releases 下对应平台的包，解压就跑 ——\n见 下载与安装"},"231":{"id":"/docs-18","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"要自己编：见 从源码构建"},"232":{"id":"/docs-19","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"要写插件：看 插件总览"},"233":{"id":"/docs-20","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"想改框架：看 开发文档"},"234":{"id":"/docs-21","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"卡住了：看 常见问题"},"235":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"page","content":"ABI 契约","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi"},"236":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi","content":"HostApiVTable、四个符号、内存所有权与版本协商"},"237":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的四个符号","content":"插件必须导出的四个符号"},"238":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"HostApiVTable：18 个字段"},"239":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"内存所有权：三条硬规矩"},"240":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"版本协商"},"241":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"为什么本 ABI 一个可变参数函数指针都没有"},"242":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"五种语言各自声明的兼容 ABI 版本"},"243":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"回调为什么是 `C-unwind`"},"244":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi","content":"这是**唯一**的跨语言契约：形状只有 `fuyubot-abi/src/lib.rs` 一份实现，C 头文件\n`fuyubot_plugin.h` 由 cbindgen 从它生成（**产物，不是源码**，别手改）。宿主侧所有桥在\n`fuyubot-loader/src/runtime.rs`。**改 ABI = 改那个文件 + 加版本号。**"},"245":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的四个符号","content":"| 符号            | 类型                                                           | 必须吗    | 说明                                              |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(*const HostApiVTable) -> PluginHandle` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-0"},"246":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的四个符号","content":"| 符号             | 类型                                                         | 必须吗 | 说明                                  |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle, *const c_char) -> i32` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件；返回 `0` 成功 |","table":"table-0"},"247":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的四个符号","content":"| 符号            | 类型                                   | 必须吗 | 说明             |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------ | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle)` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"248":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的四个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 类型                                  | 必须吗    | 说明                                |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(*mut c_char)` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-0"},"249":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的四个符号","content":"符号名由常量钉住（`SYM_PLUGIN_INIT` / `SYM_PLUGIN_START` / `SYM_PLUGIN_STOP` /\n`SYM_PLUGIN_FREE_STRING`），`PluginLoader::load_with_config` 按这些名字 `lib.get(...)`。\nC++ 里必须把它们放进 `extern \"C\"` 块，否则名字被 mangle，宿主 dlsym 不到。"},"250":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的四个符号","content":"`PluginHandle` = `{ abi_version: u32, size: u32, context: *mut c_void, name: *const c_char }`；\n`is_valid()` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以插件的 `context` 不能是\n`NULL`。`PluginHandle::FAILED` 是全零版本号，`const _` 里有\n`assert!(PluginHandle::FAILED.abi_version == 0)`。"},"251":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"`version` 在偏移 0、`size` 在 4、`host_ctx` 在 8，其余 15 个是函数指针，全是 `Option<...>`；\n总大小 = `2 * size_of::<u32>() + 16 * size_of::<*const c_void>()`，由 `const _` 里的\n`offset_of!` / `size_of` 断言钉死。每个函数第一个参数都是 `host: *mut c_void`。"},"252":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"下表签名省略第一个参数 `host`："},"253":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段        | 签名    | 宿主实现          | 说明                                        |\n| --- | --------- | ----- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| —   | `version` | `u32` | `ABI_VERSION` | 必须等于 `ABI_VERSION`；首个字段，插件能在读其它任何字段之前先比一次 |","table":"table-1"},"254":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段     | 签名    | 宿主实现                         | 说明                                  |\n| --- | ------ | ----- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| —   | `size` | `u32` | `size_of::<HostApiVTable>()` | 老宿主 + 新插件时先比 `size` 再读尾部字段，读越界就是 UB |","table":"table-1"},"255":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段         | 签名            | 宿主实现           | 说明                                 |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------- | -------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| —   | `host_ctx` | `*mut c_void` | `&HostRuntime` | 每个函数都原样回传；插件作者看不见它（`HostApi` 自动带上） |","table":"table-1"},"256":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段   | 签名                                                                      | 宿主实现     | 说明                                                                         |\n| --- | ---- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | `on` | `(update_type, filter_json, callback, user_data) -> SubscriptionHandle` | `api_on` | 订阅；`filter_json` 里的 `event_type` 选通道，其余键做负载匹配；`NULL` / 空串 / `\"null\"` = 收全部 |","table":"table-1"},"257":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段    | 签名               | 宿主实现      | 说明                   |\n| --- | ----- | ---------------- | --------- | -------------------- |\n| 2   | `off` | `(handle) -> ()` | `api_off` | 退订；句柄 drop 时宿主也会整批回滚 |","table":"table-1"},"258":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段     | 签名                                  | 宿主实现       | 说明                                              |\n| --- | ------ | ----------------------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | `emit` | `(event_type, payload_json) -> i32` | `api_emit` | 发自定义事件；对插件而言是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`，只送自己 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-1"},"259":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段              | 签名                                | 宿主实现                | 说明                                                    |\n| --- | --------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | `register_tool` | `(descriptor_json) -> ToolHandle` | `api_register_tool` | 只登记元数据；本版 ABI 没有处理器指针，登记出来的一律是 `handler: None` 的声明型工具 |","table":"table-1"},"260":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段          | 签名                                | 宿主实现            | 说明                                                                 |\n| --- | ----------- | --------------------------------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 5   | `call_tool` | `(name, input_json) -> RequestId` | `api_call_tool` | 走 `ToolRegistry::call_tool`（查表 → 权限门 → schema → 处理器）；没有处理器就返回无效请求号 |","table":"table-1"},"261":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                    | 宿主实现             | 说明                                 |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------- | ---------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 6   | `list_tools` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_list_tools` | 全部工具的元数据 JSON 数组。**宿主线程局部缓冲**，读完即弃 |","table":"table-1"},"262":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                                              | 宿主实现                  | 说明                       |\n| --- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| 7   | `provide_service` | `(name, *const ServiceVTable) -> ServiceHandle` | `api_provide_service` | 注册命名服务；`vtable` 必须活到注销为止 |","table":"table-1"},"263":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段            | 签名                               | 宿主实现              | 说明                  |\n| --- | ------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------- |\n| 8   | `get_service` | `(name) -> *const ServiceVTable` | `api_get_service` | 取回同一个指针；没有就是 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"264":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段          | 签名                           | 宿主实现            | 说明                           |\n| --- | ----------- | ---------------------------- | --------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 9   | `td_invoke` | `(method_json) -> RequestId` | `api_td_invoke` | 发完整 TDLib 请求 JSON（含 `@type`） |","table":"table-1"},"265":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段                     | 签名                                        | 宿主实现                       | 说明                                                      |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 10  | `td_invoke_simplified` | `(method_name, params_json) -> RequestId` | `api_td_invoke_simplified` | 给参数补上 `@type = method_name`；参数不是对象就整份替换成 `{\"@type\": …}` |","table":"table-1"},"266":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                                | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                              |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------------------- | ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 11  | `td_execute` | `(request_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_td_execute` | **同步**执行不碰网络的方法（`td_json_client_execute`），当场返回响应 JSON。**不发请求号、不进请求留档、不等响应通道**——所以能在事件回调里用；宿主没接 TDLib 时返回 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"267":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段               | 签名                                                      | 宿主实现                 | 说明                     |\n| --- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 12  | `use_middleware` | `(stage: u32, callback, user_data) -> MiddlewareHandle` | `api_use_middleware` | 挂在某个阶段；回调返回非 0 → 本阶段中断 |","table":"table-1"},"268":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                                             | 宿主实现                  | 说明                                     |\n| --- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| 13  | `wait_for_update` | `(filter_json, timeout_ms: u64) -> WaitHandle` | `api_wait_for_update` | **阻塞**当前线程；`timeout_ms == 0` 表示只检查当前状态 |","table":"table-1"},"269":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段            | 签名               | 宿主实现              | 说明         |\n| --- | ------------- | ---------------- | ----------------- | ---------- |\n| 14  | `cancel_wait` | `(handle) -> ()` | `api_cancel_wait` | 从另一个线程取消等待 |","table":"table-1"},"270":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"| #   | 字段    | 签名                            | 宿主实现      | 说明                                                              |\n| --- | ----- | ----------------------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 15  | `log` | `(level: u32, message) -> ()` | `api_log` | 落进宿主环形缓冲（`LOG_CAPACITY = 256`）并打一行到 stderr；非法 level 按 `Info` 处理 |","table":"table-1"},"271":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"两条形状上的硬要求："},"272":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"**第一个参数总是 `host: *mut c_void`**：裸函数指针没有捕获环境，VTable 里放不了闭包；\n不给显式上下文就只能靠进程级全局，那样一个进程只能有一个宿主、测试也没法并行。"},"273":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"**每个函数指针字段都是 `Option<...>`**：C 侧传 `NULL` 合法，非 `Option` 字段收到 `NULL` 就是 UB。\nRust 侧 `HostApi::from_raw` 一次解包校验全部 15 个，之后调用路径上没有 `Option`、也没有 panic 分支。"},"274":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtable18-个字段","content":"句柄类型（`SubscriptionHandle` / `ToolHandle` / `ServiceHandle` / `MiddlewareHandle` / `RequestId`）\n都是 `#[repr(C)]` + 单个 `u64`（断言钉住 `size_of == size_of::<u64>()`）；\n`LogLevel` = 1..5（`Error` / `Warn` / `Info` / `Debug` / `Trace`），`Stage` = 0..5；\n`WaitHandle` = `{ id: u64, matched: u32, _reserved: u32, payload_json: *const c_char }`。"},"275":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**谁分配谁释放**。插件通过 `plugin_init` 返回的 `name`、以及插件自己分配的任何字符串，\n都由插件持有；宿主**绝不** free 它们。插件要给宿主一个需要接管的临时字符串，只能走\n`plugin_free_string` 那套约定。"},"276":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**宿主返回的字符串是线程局部缓冲**。`list_tools`、`get_service`、`WaitHandle::payload_json`\n指向宿主的一块复用缓冲（`thread_local! HOST_STRING`），**只在下一次调用宿主函数之前有效**。\n要留着就当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**——VTable 里没有 host 侧的 free 函数，这是设计不是遗漏。"},"277":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**`ServiceMethodFn` 的返回值由提供方持有**，调用方读完即弃。"},"278":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                    | 谁比           | 不匹配的后果 |\n| --------------------- | ------------ | ------ |\n| `ABI_VERSION`（当前 `2`） | 编译期常量，两侧共同引用 | —      |","table":"table-2"},"279":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                       | 谁比                      | 不匹配的后果                      |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable::version` | 插件侧 `HostApi::from_raw` | `AbiError::VersionMismatch` |","table":"table-2"},"280":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                    | 谁比  | 不匹配的后果                     |\n| --------------------- | --- | -------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable::size` | 同上  | `AbiError::VTableTooSmall` |","table":"table-2"},"281":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置             | 谁比  | 不匹配的后果                               |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 某个函数指针是 `NULL` | 同上  | `AbiError::MissingFunction(\"<字段名>\")` |","table":"table-2"},"282":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                          | 谁比                 | 不匹配的后果                 |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| `PluginHandle::abi_version` | 宿主侧 `PluginLoader` | `AbiMismatch`：**拒绝加载** |","table":"table-2"},"283":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"版本不兼容时宿主**不能**调 `plugin_stop`——那是对一个不认识的 ABI 下手，所以插件在 `init` 里\n分配的状态这一版回收不了。字段只增不改，新增一律追加在尾部。"},"284":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 2 的改动**：尾部追加了 `td_execute`（同步执行，见上表第 11 项）。追加字段本身不破坏老插件\n（它们先比 `size`），但按契约「改 ABI 就加版本号」，`ABI_VERSION` 一起从 1 跳到 2——**用版本 1\n编出来的插件会被宿主拒绝加载**，重新编一次即可（仓库里所有插件与模板都从 `ABI_VERSION` 取值）。"},"285":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"Rust 的 `extern \"C\" fn(.., ...)` 确实稳定（能写、cbindgen 也能生成），但**本 ABI 一个都没用**，\n理由只有一条：`...` 会把**参数类型和个数校验全部丢掉**。VTable 里 15 个函数的参数都是固定的，\n用 `...` 只会让 C 侧传错参数从编译错误降级成运行期 UB。"},"286":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"将来真要加，正确的声明形状是（C 侧）："},"287":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"两条必须知道的事："},"288":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"变参部分**不能**是唯一的参数——C 要求 `...` 之前至少有一个具名参数。"},"289":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"**变参函数指针跨不了 ABI 的 `Option` 优化**：`Option<fn(..., ...)>` 不是 niche 优化，占**两个指针宽**，\n必须显式判空。本 crate 里那条\n`size_of::<Option<unsafe extern \"C\" fn()>>() == size_of::<*const c_void>()` 断言只对**非变参**函数指针\n成立；普通函数指针字段能享受 niche 优化（`NULL` 就是 `None`），这也是「整个 VTable 所有字段都能是\n`Option<...>` 且不撑大布局」的前提之一。"},"290":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言  | 声明在哪                                              | 值   | 怎么生效                                                                      |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| C   | 头文件 `fuyubot_plugin.h` 里的 `#define ABI_VERSION 2` | 2   | 模板里写 `if (host == NULL \\|\\| host->version != ABI_VERSION) return failed;` |","table":"table-3"},"291":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言  | 声明在哪                   | 值   | 怎么生效                   |\n| --- | ---------------------- | --- | ---------------------- |\n| C++ | 同一份 `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 2   | 同上（四个符号放 `extern \"C\"`） |","table":"table-3"},"292":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言   | 声明在哪                                                                                   | 值   | 怎么生效                                              |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| Rust | `fuyubot_plugin_api::SDK_ABI_VERSION`、`COMPATIBLE_HOST_ABI_VERSIONS`、`is_compatible()` | 2   | `define_plugin!` 把它填进 `PluginHandle::abi_version` |","table":"table-3"},"293":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言     | 声明在哪          | 值   | 怎么生效                                                              |\n| ------ | ------------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Python | **脚本不接触 ABI** | —   | 由中间插件 `fuyubot_python_host` 承载（标准 ABI v2 cdylib），`abi_version` 它填 |","table":"table-3"},"294":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言      | 声明在哪          | 值   | 怎么生效                      |\n| ------- | ------------- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| JS / TS | **脚本不接触 ABI** | —   | 同上，由 `fuyubot_js_host` 承载 |","table":"table-3"},"295":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"脚本插件走的是薄 SDK（`fuyubot.py` / `fuyubot.ts`）→ 原生桥 → 中间插件这条路，\n**作者永远不碰 C ABI**；ABI 版本由承载它的那份 cdylib 声明。Python 与 JS 的中间插件\n是同一套机制的两份实现，「两门语言对 ABI 的理解」不可能漂移。"},"296":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"`EventCallbackFn` 与 `MiddlewareCallbackFn` 都是 `unsafe extern \"C-unwind\" fn(...)`。\n`extern \"C\"` 边界上逃出去的 panic 会直接 **abort 整个进程**，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind`；\n`C-unwind` 允许 unwind 穿过边界，宿主就能接住、记一条日志、继续跑下一条更新。\n对 C/C++ 而言两者 ABI 完全一致；C++ 异常同样会穿过这个边界，**请自己在回调内处理完**。"},"297":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"`define_plugin!` 生成的三个导出函数还会把插件代码包在 `catch_unwind` 里——两层都要。"},"298":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"版本不兼容时宿主**不会**调 `plugin_stop`：那是对一个不认识的 ABI 下手。字段只增不改，\n新增一律追加在尾部；改动必须同时抬 `ABI_VERSION`。"},"299":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"page","content":"订阅与事件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events"},"300":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events","content":"on/off/emit、过滤器、双通道与归属"},"301":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"双通道：具体 `@type` 与兜底 `update`"},"302":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"过滤器"},"303":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"归属：`emit` 不是广播"},"304":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"Rust"},"305":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#python--js薄-sdk","content":"Python / JS（薄 SDK）"},"306":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events","content":"事件总线是插件拿到 TDLib 更新的唯一入口，也是插件之间说话的方式。三个动作：\n`on` 订阅（返回句柄）、`off` 退订（或让句柄 drop）、`emit` 发自定义事件。"},"307":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"每条更新会被**同时**发到两条通道上："},"308":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道                                | 谁收         | 什么时候用    |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------- | -------- |\n| 具体的 `@type`（`updateNewMessage` 等） | 精确订阅了它的监听器 | 你只关心一种更新 |","table":"table-0"},"309":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道         | 谁收           | 什么时候用                 |\n| ---------- | ------------ | --------------------- |\n| `\"update\"` | 订阅兜底通道的所有监听器 | 你要看全部，或不想追 TDLib 的类型名 |","table":"table-0"},"310":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道           | 谁收               | 什么时候用              |\n| ------------ | ---------------- | ------------------ |\n| `\"response\"` | **只发给发起那个请求的插件** | 收 `td_invoke*` 的结果 |","table":"table-0"},"311":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"`\"update\"` 与 `\"response\"` 是 ABI 常量（`UPDATE_EVENT` / `RESPONSE_EVENT`），别自己拼字符串。"},"312":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"`on` 的第三个参数是一份过滤器 JSON：**点分路径 → 期望值**。"},"313":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则                       | 说明                                                                |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `event_type` 键只用来**选通道** | `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}` 表示等 5 号响应；它**不参与负载匹配** |","table":"table-1"},"314":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则           | 说明                                                            |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 其余键做负载字段相等匹配 | 字段位置随更新类型变：`updateNewMessage` 的 `chat_id` 在 `message.chat_id` |","table":"table-1"},"315":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则              | 说明    |\n| --------------- | ----- |\n| 空 / `null` / 不传 | 该通道全收 |","table":"table-1"},"316":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"同一个事件可以订阅**多次**、各带各的过滤器。脚本侧按订阅号 `handle` 分发，所以不该响的回调不会响。"},"317":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"插件里调 `emit` 走的是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`：只送给**该插件自己 + 全局订阅者**。\n归属的语义是「**额外定向**」而不是「排除广播」——宿主 `emit` 的更新照旧发给所有订阅者，\n`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 只是在那份收件人之外**再加**上 `owner` 自己的订阅。"},"318":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发             | 谁收得到     |\n| -------------- | -------- |\n| 宿主发更新 / `emit` | 所有匹配的订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"319":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发                | 谁收得到              |\n| ----------------- | ----------------- |\n| 插件 `emit(\"x\", …)` | 该插件自己的订阅者 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"320":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发    | 谁收得到                                       |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 宿主的响应 | `emit_scoped(发起者, \"response\", …)`：全局 + 发起者 |","table":"table-2"},"321":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"要让别的插件收到你的事件，**让对方订阅全局事件**，不要指望你的 `emit` 是一次广播。"},"322":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"订阅句柄必须活着。Rust 侧 `HostExt::subscribe_json` 返回的是 `#[must_use]` 的\n`Subscription`，**drop 就是退订**；`let _ = …` 会立刻退订。插件卸载时宿主还会整批回滚，\n但那已经是另一回事了。"},"323":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"回调用 `extern \"C-unwind\" fn(user_data, payload) -> i32`，返回 `0` 表示成功；`payload` 是宿主临时的\nNUL 结尾字符串，要留就当场拷走（`parse_payload` 已经替你解析成 `serde_json::Value`）。"},"324":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#python--js薄-sdk","content":"脚本侧的订阅**没有退订接口**——注册后一直有效，随插件停止一起撤。\n方法的逐个说明见 Python 插件 / JS 与 TS 插件。"},"325":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#python--js薄-sdk","content":"要按固定次数等一条更新（阻塞式），用 `wait_for_update`，见 调用 TDLib。\n要改流经管线的负载，用中间件，见 工具与中间件。"},"326":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"page","content":"Go 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go"},"327":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"cgo 编 c-shared，逻辑用 Go 写、ABI 用一层 C 薄壳"},"328":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"结构：Go 写逻辑，C 写壳"},"329":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"编译"},"330":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"一个宿主行为要记住：Go 库不会被卸载"},"331":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"验证"},"332":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"相关"},"333":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"Go 也能写插件：`go build -buildmode=c-shared` 出来的就是标准动态库，宿主只要看到四个导出符号\n就认它。完整可跑的示例在 `examples/go-ping`。"},"334":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"目前**没有** `fuyubot-sdk init --lang go` 模板——Go 这条路线是「自己搭工程」：\n抄 `examples/go-ping`，或者照下面这两段写。C 头文件仍然用\n`fuyubot-sdk codegen --lang c --dir <工程目录>` 生成，不要手抄。"},"335":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件        | 作用                               |\n| --------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `main.go` | 逻辑：解析更新 JSON、拼 `sendMessage`、打日志 |","table":"table-0"},"336":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件         | 作用                                                                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin.c` | 四个 ABI 符号：`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string` |","table":"table-0"},"337":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件                 | 作用                                 |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 生成物（`codegen --lang c` 落的），**不提交** |","table":"table-0"},"338":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"为什么不直接 `//export plugin_init`：`PluginHandle` 是**按值返回**的结构体，由 C 侧构造最稳；\n也避免把宿主 VTable 的函数指针搬进 Go。C 侧只做转发："},"339":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"Go 侧通过两个 C 小桥访问宿主（这样 Go 里不用碰函数指针）："},"340":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"`fy_log` / `fy_invoke` 在 `plugin.c` 里实现，就是 `g_host->log` / `g_host->td_invoke_simplified` 的转发。"},"341":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"cgo 需要 C 编译器：Linux / macOS 用 `cc`，Windows 用 mingw-w64（如\nw64devkit）。"},"342":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"Windows 上没装 mingw 时报 `gcc: executable file not found` 或\n`cannot open file 'mingwex.lib'`——那是缺 C 工具链，不是插件代码的问题。\nMSVC 的 `cl` 不能直接给 cgo 用（Go 的 Windows 外部链接器要 GCC 那一套）。"},"343":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"Go 的 `c-shared` 运行时有线程与信号处理器，`FreeLibrary` / `dlclose` 之后进程会直接\naccess violation（`0xC0000005`）。"},"344":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"所以 `fuyubot-loader` 会识别 Go 产物（文件里的 `\\xff Go buildinf:` 魔数），\n**故意不卸载**这类库：`plugin_stop` 照跑、注册照回滚，只是那几 MB 库内存留到进程退出。\n普通 Rust / C / C++ 插件不受影响，仍是 drop 即卸载。"},"345":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"这也意味着：**别在同一个进程里反复加载同一个 Go 插件**（热重载路径别指望它）。\n先 `fuyubot stop` 再 `run`，行为是干净的。"},"346":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"回放输出里应能看到 `go-ping 插件：回了 pong` 和一条\n`sendMessage {\"chat_id\":…,\"input_message_content\":{\"@type\":\"inputMessageText\",…}}`。"},"347":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"ABI 细节（17 个字段、内存所有权、版本协商）：ABI 契约"},"348":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"C / C++ 的写法（同一份头文件）：C 与 C++ 插件"},"349":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"订阅与过滤器：订阅与事件"},"350":{"id":"/docs/plugin","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"page","content":"插件总览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin"},"351":{"id":"/docs/plugin-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"原生插件（一个 cdylib）与脚本插件（一个目录），以及四种导出符号"},"352":{"id":"/docs/plugin-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"原生插件：四个导出符号"},"353":{"id":"/docs/plugin-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"最小闭环（原生插件）"},"354":{"id":"/docs/plugin-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"写原生插件要知道的六件事"},"355":{"id":"/docs/plugin-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"按语言看"},"356":{"id":"/docs/plugin-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"按能力看"},"357":{"id":"/docs/plugin-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名与目录"},"358":{"id":"/docs/plugin-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"**插件有两种形态**，按需求选："},"359":{"id":"/docs/plugin-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件           | 脚本插件             |\n| --- | -------------- | ---------------- |\n| 语言  | Rust / C / C++ | Python / JS / TS |","table":"table-0"},"360":{"id":"/docs/plugin-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件                                 | 脚本插件                        |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |\n| 形态  | 一个 cdylib（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`） | 一个目录（manifest + 脚本 + 薄 SDK） |","table":"table-0"},"361":{"id":"/docs/plugin-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件              | 脚本插件         |\n| --- | ----------------- | ------------ |\n| 边界  | 与宿主同进程，C ABI 函数调用 | 一个脚本一个解释器子进程 |","table":"table-0"},"362":{"id":"/docs/plugin-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件 | 脚本插件          |\n| --- | ---- | ------------- |\n| 崩溃  | 拖垮宿主 | 只有子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-0"},"363":{"id":"/docs/plugin-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|      | 原生插件        | 脚本插件    |\n| ---- | ----------- | ------- |\n| 要编译吗 | 要（用你自己的工具链） | 不要，装上就跑 |","table":"table-0"},"364":{"id":"/docs/plugin-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件                                | 脚本插件   |\n| --- | ----------------------------------- | ------ |\n| 起步  | `fuyubot-sdk init demo --lang rust` | 看 脚本插件 |","table":"table-0"},"365":{"id":"/docs/plugin-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"**只想写脚本？** 看 脚本插件：一个目录就是一个插件，\n不编译、不碰 ABI，`fuyubot plugin install` 装上就跑。"},"366":{"id":"/docs/plugin-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"一个原生插件 = 一个 cdylib。宿主 `dlopen` 它，只认四个导出符号，\n其余全部能力都经 `HostApiVTable` 回调宿主。插件不认识 Rust 内核，也不需要认识。"},"367":{"id":"/docs/plugin-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 干什么                                               |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造插件状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-1"},"368":{"id":"/docs/plugin-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 干什么                       |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件 |","table":"table-1"},"369":{"id":"/docs/plugin-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 干什么            |\n| ------------- | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-1"},"370":{"id":"/docs/plugin-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 干什么                               |\n| -------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-1"},"371":{"id":"/docs/plugin-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"契约细节（字段布局、内存所有权、版本协商）见 ABI 契约。"},"372":{"id":"/docs/plugin-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot init` 重复执行会被挡住（不覆盖你改过的配置）；三个键都有默认值，最简可以只有 `[bot]`。"},"373":{"id":"/docs/plugin-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（会拼进源码与 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"374":{"id":"/docs/plugin-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"**产物落在哪**：`plugin install <工程目录>` 只看 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` 与工程目录本身。\n插件若是**当前 workspace 的成员**，`cargo build -p <crate>` 默认把产物放在仓库根的 `target/`，于是它找不到\n——加 `--target-dir <工程目录>/target`，或直接指着产物装。"},"375":{"id":"/docs/plugin-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"**SDK 走源码开发时**设 `FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH` 指向 FuyuBot-SDK 仓库的 `crates/`，生成的插件会写 `path = \"…\"`；\n不设就写 crates.io 版本号。"},"376":{"id":"/docs/plugin-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot` 管运行，`fuyubot-sdk` 管开发，**两个都不编译插件**：编译是作者自己语言工具链的事\n（`cargo build` / `cl /LD` / `gcc -shared`）。`fuyubot plugin install` 只**复制**已编好的产物。"},"377":{"id":"/docs/plugin-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                       | 说明                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回调是 `extern \"C-unwind\"` | 用 `extern \"C\"` 的话，逃出去的 panic 直接 abort 整个进程，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind` |","table":"table-2"},"378":{"id":"/docs/plugin-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                               | 说明                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 一个 crate 只展开一次 `define_plugin!` | 四个符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次就是重复定义 |","table":"table-2"},"379":{"id":"/docs/plugin-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事             | 说明                                         |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| ABI 版本目前是 `2` | 不匹配时宿主**拒绝加载**，而且**不能**调 `plugin_stop` 收状态 |","table":"table-2"},"380":{"id":"/docs/plugin-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事        | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| 订阅句柄必须活着 | Rust 侧是 `#[must_use]` 的守卫，drop 就是退订 |","table":"table-2"},"381":{"id":"/docs/plugin-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事              | 说明                                         |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 插件 `emit` 不是广播 | 只送**自己 + 全局订阅者**（`emit_scoped`），影响别的插件要靠订阅 |","table":"table-2"},"382":{"id":"/docs/plugin-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事      | 说明                                       |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 谁分配谁释放 | 宿主绝不 free 插件的指针；宿主给的字符串是线程局部缓冲，下次宿主调用前有效 |","table":"table-2"},"383":{"id":"/docs/plugin-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Rust 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rust/\" />"},"384":{"id":"/docs/plugin-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"C 与 C++ 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/native/\" />"},"385":{"id":"/docs/plugin-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Go 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/go/\" />"},"386":{"id":"/docs/plugin-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Python 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/python/\" />"},"387":{"id":"/docs/plugin-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"JS 与 TypeScript 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/js-ts/\" />"},"388":{"id":"/docs/plugin-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"订阅与事件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/events/\" />"},"389":{"id":"/docs/plugin-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调用 TDLib\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tdlib/\" />"},"390":{"id":"/docs/plugin-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"富消息\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rich/\" />"},"391":{"id":"/docs/plugin-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"工具与中间件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tools/\" />"},"392":{"id":"/docs/plugin-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"ABI 契约\" href=\"/docs/plugin/abi/\" />"},"393":{"id":"/docs/plugin-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调试与安装\" href=\"/docs/plugin/testing/\" />"},"394":{"id":"/docs/plugin-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（它会拼进源码和 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"395":{"id":"/docs/plugin-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"**原生插件名只有 dlopen 之后才知道**：它来自 `plugin_init` 返回的 `PluginHandle`，所以\n`fuyubot plugin list` 会真的加载一次再看名字。"},"396":{"id":"/docs/plugin-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"**脚本插件的身份在 manifest 里**（Python 的 `[tool.fuyubot]` / JS 的 `\"fuyubot\"` 段），\n目录名是装卸载的单位（`fuyubot plugin install|uninstall <目录>`），见 脚本插件。"},"397":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"page","content":"JS 与 TypeScript 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts"},"398":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"薄 SDK 全部方法的用法、事件怎么触发、可抄的例子"},"399":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"400":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么触发"},"401":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"`on` — 订阅事件"},"402":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],