s":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 干什么                     |\n| -------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params?, onResponse?)` | 调一次 TDLib 接口（发消息、取资料……） |","table":"table-0"},"414":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                      | 干什么      |\n| ----------------------- | -------- |\n| `emit(event, payload?)` | 发一条自定义事件 |","table":"table-0"},"415":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 干什么 |\n| ------------------------------ | --- |\n| `log(message, level = \"info\")` | 打日志 |","table":"table-0"},"416":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                   | 干什么    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `registerTool(name, description = \"\", inputSchema?)` | 登记一个工具 |","table":"table-0"},"417":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 干什么    |\n| ------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `useMiddleware(stage, handler)` | 挂一个中间件 |","table":"table-0"},"418":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 干什么                   |\n| ------- | --------------------- |\n| `run()` | 握手并开始收事件——**永远是最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"419":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"你的函数只有**被事件触发**才会跑。事件有两个来源："},"420":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"**TDLib 更新**：来一条消息、消息发送成功……每种更新是一个事件，**事件名就是更新的 `@type`**\n（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded` ……）。每条更新会同时发到两个通道：\n具体的 `@type` 事件，和兜底的 `\"update\"` 事件（订阅它可以看全部）。"},"421":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"**你自己发的事件**：`emit(\"job_done\", …)` 发出的自定义事件（细节见\n订阅与事件）。"},"422":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数      | 说明                                       |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `event` | 事件名：更新的 `@type`、`\"update\"`（全部更新）或你自定义的名字 |","table":"table-1"},"423":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数        | 说明                                |\n| --------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `handler` | 回调函数，收到一个 `payload`（解析好的对象，直接取字段） |","table":"table-1"},"424":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数       | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `filter` | 可选。只收负载里**指定字段等于指定值**的事件（点分路径写法，见下） |","table":"table-1"},"425":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。"},"426":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"**过滤器**：`{ \"点分路径\": 期望值 }`，负载里那个字段**等于**期望值才触发："},"427":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"发一个 TDLib 请求。方法名与参数名**以 TDLib 为准**（不是 Bot API），查法见\n调用 TDLib。给了 `onResponse` 时回调按 `request_id` **自动配对**，\n不用自己记请求号。"},"428":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立即返回。响应回来时你的 `onResponse` 被调用。\n不传 `onResponse` 就是「发完不管」。"},"429":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#emit--发自定义事件","content":"给**自己 + 全局订阅者**发一条自定义事件（不是广播给所有插件，见 订阅与事件）。\n适合在自己内部做「任务完成」之类的信号："},"430":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#log--打日志","content":"`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace`。排查问题时把配置里\n`[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见配置文件）。"},"431":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#registertool--登记工具","content":"只登记**元数据**（名字、说明、参数的 JSON Schema），让宿主知道有这个工具；\n调用分发看 工具与中间件。"},"432":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#usemiddleware--挂中间件","content":"`handler(stage, payload)` 在更新流经管线时被调用，可以检查或改写负载。\n`stage` 是阶段号；细节看 工具与中间件。"},"433":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#run--启动","content":"发就绪握手、开始收事件，**阻塞到进程结束**。**必须是最后一行**——它提前返回 = 插件加载失败。"},"434":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**Echo 机器人**——回声复读："},"435":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的："},"436":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**按聊天计数**——记住状态："},"437":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**原生桥**：薄 SDK 要加载原生桥（和托管插件同一份库）。查找顺序：脚本同目录 →\n环境变量 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` → 当前工作目录。找不到会报\n「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」，排法见 脚本插件常见问题。"},"438":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`bun fuyubot.ts` 验证 API 形状（不碰宿主），输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`。"},"439":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：要装 bun（机器人用 `bun install` 装依赖、`bun` 起脚本）。"},"440":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段**：JS 侧没有 schema，先判空或 `as any` 再取；\n`updateNewMessage` 的文本在 `message.content.text.text`。"},"441":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"page","content":"C 与 C++ 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native"},"442":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"同一份头文件、extern \"C\"、用你自己的工具链编译"},"443":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"四个符号"},"444":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"C"},"445":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"C++"},"446":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编译（你自己的工具链）"},"447":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"注意"},"448":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C 与 C++ 用**同一份头文件** `fuyubot_plugin.h`，差别只有两条：导出符号要不要放进 `extern \"C\"`，\n以及用什么拼 JSON。头文件是**产物**，不是源码——它由 cbindgen 从 Rust 定义生成，\n用 `fuyubot-sdk codegen` 落盘，别手改（改了下次就被覆盖）。"},"449":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 说明                                                           |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 比 `host->version != ABI_VERSION`，存下 VTable，返回 `PluginHandle` |","table":"table-0"},"450":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| -------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 订阅/注册；返回 `0` 表示成功 |","table":"table-0"},"451":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| ------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 清状态；只登记元数据的插件可以不写 |","table":"table-0"},"452":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 说明                         |\n| -------------------- | ------ | -------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 本插件不往外送字符串时也得有个空实现（宿主可能调它） |","table":"table-0"},"453":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"`PluginHandle` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以 `context` 不能给 `NULL`。\n版本不对就返回全零句柄，宿主会把它当成拒绝加载。"},"454":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"`ABI_VERSION` 与 `FUYUBOT_EXPORT` 都来自头文件，不要自己写死。"},"455":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"同 C，**唯一的硬差别**是四个导出符号必须在 `extern \"C\"` 里——C++ 会改函数名（mangling），\n宿主按 ABI 定死的名字 `dlsym`，改了就找不到。"},"456":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"`C-unwind` 对 C/C++ 而言与普通 C 调用**ABI 一致**，但 C++ 的异常照样能穿过这个边界——\n逃到宿主那边的异常是未定义行为。**在回调内部把异常处理完再返回**。"},"457":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"`/utf-8` 省掉的后果很难看：中文注释被按系统代码页拆坏，编译器报的是「注释提前结束、后面全是语法错误」。"},"458":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编完装进插件目录："},"459":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"模板里的 JSON 取值是**朴素查找**（`strstr`），不处理转义、不处理同名嵌套键；认真写就引一个 JSON 库。"},"460":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"宿主返回的字符串是**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用之前有效——当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**。"},"461":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"想少拼 JSON，可以只发 `td_invoke_simplified` 需要的参数对象（`@type` 由宿主补），见 调用 TDLib。"},"462":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"page","content":"Python 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python"},"463":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"薄 SDK 全部方法的用法、事件怎么触发、可抄的例子"},"464":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"465":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么触发"},"466":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"`on` — 订阅事件"},"467":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` — 调 TDLib 接口"},"468":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#emit--发自定义事件","content":"`emit` — 发自定义事件"},"469":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#log--打日志","content":"`log` — 打日志"},"470":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#register_tool--登记工具","content":"`register_tool` — 登记工具"},"471":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#use_middleware--挂中间件","content":"`use_middleware` — 挂中间件"},"472":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#run--启动","content":"`run` — 启动"},"473":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"474":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"475":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"Python 插件就是一个目录：`pyproject.toml` 写身份，`main.py` 写逻辑，`fuyubot.py`（单文件薄 SDK）\n管通信。上手三步见 脚本插件。本页是**方法手册 + 示例**。"},"476":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"manifest 长这样（`entry` 不写就默认 `main.py`）："},"477":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                | 干什么             |\n| --------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter=None)` | 订阅事件：事件来了就调你的函数 |","table":"table-0"},"478":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                              | 干什么                     |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params=None, on_response=None)` | 调一次 TDLib 接口（发消息、取资料……） |","table":"table-0"},"479":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 干什么      |\n| --------------------------- | -------- |\n| `emit(event, payload=None)` | 发一条自定义事件 |","table":"table-0"},"480":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                           | 干什么 |\n| ---------------------------- | --- |\n| `log(message, level=\"info\")` | 打日志 |","table":"table-0"},"481":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                       | 干什么    |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `register_tool(name, description=\"\", input_schema=None)` | 登记一个工具 |","table":"table-0"},"482":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 干什么    |\n| -------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `use_middleware(stage, handler)` | 挂一个中间件 |","table":"table-0"},"483":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 干什么                   |\n| ------- | --------------------- |\n| `run()` | 握手并开始收事件——**永远是最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"484":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"你的函数只有**被事件触发**才会跑。事件有两个来源："},"485":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"**TDLib 更新**：来一条消息、消息发送成功……每种更新是一个事件，**事件名就是更新的 `@type`**\n（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded` ……）。每条更新会同时发到两个通道：\n具体的 `@type` 事件，和兜底的 `\"update\"` 事件（订阅它可以看全部）。"},"486":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"**你自己发的事件**：`emit(\"job_done\", …)` 发出的自定义事件（细节见\n订阅与事件）。"},"487":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数      | 说明                                       |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `event` | 事件名：更新的 `@type`、`\"update\"`（全部更新）或你自定义的名字 |","table":"table-1"},"488":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数        | 说明                                     |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `handler` | 回调函数，收到一个 `payload`（解析好的 `dict`，直接取字段） |","table":"table-1"},"489":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数       | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `filter` | 可选。只收负载里**指定字段等于指定值**的事件（点分路径写法，见下） |","table":"table-1"},"490":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"**是两参数函数，不是装饰器**——`@on(...)` 会报错，老老实实 `on(事件, 函数)`。\n同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。"},"491":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"**过滤器**：`{\"点分路径\": 期望值}`，负载里那个字段**等于**期望值才触发："},"492":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"发一个 TDLib 请求。方法名与参数名**以 TDLib 为准**（不是 Bot API），查法见\n调用 TDLib。给了 `on_response` 时回调按 `request_id` **自动配对**，\n不用自己记请求号。"},"493":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立即返回。响应回来时你的 `on_response` 被调用。\n不传 `on_response` 就是「发完不管」。"},"494":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#emit--发自定义事件","content":"给**自己 + 全局订阅者**发一条自定义事件（不是广播给所有插件，见 订阅与事件）。\n适合在自己内部做「任务完成」之类的信号："},"495":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#log--打日志","content":"`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace`。排查问题时把配置里\n`[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见配置文件）。"},"496":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#register_tool--登记工具","content":"只登记**元数据**（名字、说明、参数的 JSON Schema），让宿主知道有这个工具；\n调用分发看 工具与中间件。"},"497":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#use_middleware--挂中间件","content":"`handler(stage, payload)` 在更新流经管线时被调用，可以检查或改写负载。\n`stage` 是阶段号；细节看 工具与中间件。"},"498":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#run--启动","content":"发就绪握手、开始收事件，**阻塞到进程结束**。**必须是最后一行**——它提前返回 = 插件加载失败。"},"499":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**Echo 机器人**——回声复读："},"500":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的："},"501":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**看全部流量**——兜底通道记日志："},"502":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**原生桥**：薄 SDK 要加载原生桥（和托管插件同一份库）。查找顺序：脚本同目录 →\n环境变量 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` → 当前工作目录。找不到会报\n「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」，排法见 脚本插件常见问题。"},"503":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`python fuyubot.py` 验证 API 形状（不碰宿主），输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`。"},"504":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：要装 uv（机器人用 `uv sync` 装依赖、`uv run` 起脚本）。"},"505":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段**：先判空再取（`dict.get()`），不同更新类型的字段位置不一样；\n`updateNewMessage` 的文本在 `message.content.text.text`。"},"506":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"page","content":"富消息","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich"},"507":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"messageRichMessage：块树排版、按钮行与本地 Markdown 转换"},"508":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"三种源"},"509":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"发送与编辑"},"510":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮"},"511":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"行内富文本：`richtext`"},"512":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"覆盖靠测试钉着"},"513":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 的富消息（`messageRichMessage`）是「一页排版」的消息：标题、段落、表格、代码块、\n按钮行……全是一块一块的**页块**（`InputPageBlock`），行内另有独立的富文本（`RichText`）。\nBot API 管它叫 Rich Messages。"},"514":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 里**没有** `sendRichMessage` / `editRichMessage`，也没有自带的 md → 块树转换；\n`fuyubot-simplify` 的 `RichMessage` 把这层补齐了：发送 / 编辑就是\n`sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，Markdown 转换在**本地**完成。"},"515":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"`RichMessage` 内部是 `RichSource` 三选一："},"516":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                               | 谁解析                              | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_markdown(md)` | **本地**转换器（对齐官方 Rich Markdown 全表） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"517":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                                 | 谁解析                                | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_blocks(blocks)` | 你给现成块树（每块一条 `InputPageBlock` JSON） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"518":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源        | 构造                                 | 谁解析              | 谁能发   |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------- | ----- |\n| Markdown | `RichMessage::server_markdown(md)` | **服务端**（发前拿不到块树） | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"519":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源    | 构造                               | 谁解析     | 谁能发   |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| Html | `RichMessage::server_html(html)` | **服务端** | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"520":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"本地转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表\n一类一例全覆盖：标题 / 段落 / 围栏代码（含 `math`）/ 引用与可展开引用 / 拉引 / 页脚 /\n列表与任务项 / 表格 / 分割线 / 公式 / 折叠块 / 拼贴与幻灯片 / 媒体（按扩展名猜类型）/\n地图 / 锚点 / 按钮行 / 思考占位 / 脚注；行内粗斜删码、标记、剧透、上下标、行内公式、\n自定义 emoji、时间、`mailto:` / `tel:` / `tg://user` / 锚点链接，以及那批 HTML 标签\n（`<u>` `<details>` `<tg-collage>` `<tg-button-row>` …）。**不认的一律当普通文本**\n（引用式链接、`<table>` 这类 HTML 块不会报错，只是原样保留）。"},"521":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"参数是 `RichMessageParams`——与 `SendMessageParams` **分开的类型**（那边是「文本 + 媒体」\n二选一，混在一起互斥规则没人记得住）：`message` / `reply_to_message_id` / `topic_id` /\n`reply_markup` / `clear_draft` / `timeout_ms`。"},"522":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                         | 发出的 `@type`   | 返回               |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------- |\n| `Simplify::send_rich_message(chat_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `sendMessage` | `RequestId`（不阻塞） |","table":"table-1"},"523":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                                      | 发出的 `@type`                        | 返回                            |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::send_rich_message_wait_success(chat_id, &RichMessageParams)` | 同上，再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` | `SendConfirmation`（⚠️ **阻塞**） |","table":"table-1"},"524":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                                     | 发出的 `@type`       | 返回          |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ----------- |\n| `Simplify::edit_rich_message(chat_id, message_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `editMessageText` | `RequestId` |","table":"table-1"},"525":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"最常用的两条捷径："},"526":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮在 Markdown 里**没有语法**，一律显式构造：`RichButton::url / callback / user / copy_text`\n（`.style(RichButtonStyle)` 换样式），用 `with_buttons` / `with_button_row` 追加\n`inputPageBlockButtonRow`。"},"527":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"`with_buttons` 只对 **Blocks 源**成立——`server_markdown` / `server_html` 的按钮要用\n服务端语法自己写进文本，对它们调 `with_buttons` 会报 `RichSourceNotBlocks`。"},"528":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"块里的行内内容是独立的 `RichText`（31 个构造器，没有 offset/length）：\nMarkdown 语法能覆盖 21 个，剩下 10 个（`mention` / `hashtag` / `cashtag` /\n`bankCardNumber` / `tonAddress` / `botCommand` / `icon` / `button` / `diff` / `anchor`）\n没有 md 写法，用 `richtext::*` 拼好塞进块（配合 `with_block`）。"},"529":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"`InputPageBlock` 一共 24 个构造器，本地转换器**全都能产出**（`thinking` 只能出现在草稿消息里，\n结构上仍可构造）；`with_block` 也留给「媒体已上传、要传 `inputPhoto` 句柄」这类 md 表达不了的场景。"},"530":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"块级语法**一类一例**：`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table`（每块都再走一遍\n`td_api::InputPageBlock` 反序列化）；整段全格式回归闸是内联的 `official_sample_fully_deserializes`。"},"531":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"加块 / 删块会让 `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for` 失败——24 个构造器的\n分工表就烤在这条测试里。"},"532":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"相关：调用 TDLib（`Simplify` 的其余方法）、插件总览。"},"533":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"page","content":"Rust 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust"},"534":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"fuyubot-plugin-api 与 define_plugin! 的完整写法"},"535":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"依赖"},"536":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"最小可用插件"},"537":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`Plugin` trait"},"538":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"回调里带状态"},"539":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"编译与安装"},"540":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"Rust 插件只依赖一个 crate：`fuyubot-plugin-api`。它把 `fuyubot-abi` 的形状转成用着不疼的样子——\n`HostApi`（已解包、调用路径上没有 `Option` 和 panic 分支）、`HostExt` 便利方法、\ndrop 即退订的 `Subscription`、以及 `define_plugin!` 宏。"},"541":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"那个空的 `[workspace]` 不是多余的：没有它，cargo 会一路往上找父目录的 workspace 声明然后报错。"},"542":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"这就是 `fuyubot-sdk init demo --lang rust` 生成的模板："},"543":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                   | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `init(host) -> Result<Self, String>` | `plugin_init` | 构造状态；返回 `Err` = 加载失败 |","table":"table-0"},"544":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                                    | 对应符号           | 说明                              |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `start(&mut self, config_json) -> Result<(), String>` | `plugin_start` | 宿主已把 VTable、插件目录都准备好；订阅/注册都写在这里 |","table":"table-0"},"545":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `stop(&mut self)` | `plugin_stop` | 可选；宏随后把状态收回 `Box` 释放 |","table":"table-0"},"546":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`define_plugin!` 还会把插件代码包在 `catch_unwind` 里——和 `C-unwind` 是两层，\n**两层都要**：一层防 panic 逃出 ABI，一层防 panic 把宿主线程带走。"},"547":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"回调是裸函数指针，没有捕获环境。状态要么放插件字段、经 `user_data` 传进去，要么像\n`examples/rust-echo` 那样把 `Box<HostApi>` 的地址当 `user_data`："},"548":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"`stop` 里用 `Box::from_raw` 收回，只收一次；否则就是内存泄漏（或重复释放）。"},"549":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"`Subscription` 是 `#[must_use]`：`let _ = host.subscribe_json(…)` 会**立刻退订**。\n一定要存进插件字段。插件卸载时宿主还会整批回滚，但那时插件自己的状态已经漏了。"},"550":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"`define_plugin!` **一个 crate 只能展开一次**。一个 cdylib 就是一个插件——这不是限制，是设计：\n四个导出符号名由 ABI 定死，展开两次就是重复定义。"},"551":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"要发消息、调 TDLib、等响应，见 调用 TDLib；要按字段过滤更新，见\n订阅与事件；契约本身见 ABI 契约。"},"552":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"page","content":"脚本插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts"},"553":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts","content":"一个目录就是一个插件：Python / JS / TS 写逻辑，装上就跑"},"554":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#三步上手","content":"三步上手"},"555":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"1. 建目录、写两行"},"556":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#2-装进机器人","content":"2. 装进机器人"},"557":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#3-跑起来","content":"3. 跑起来"},"558":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"薄 SDK 能干什么"},"559":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"装好之后会发生什么"},"560":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"两种形态怎么选"},"561":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"562":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts","content":"这一页讲**脚本插件**：不编译、不碰 C ABI，用 Python 或 JS / TS 写一个目录，装进机器人就能跑。"},"563":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts","content":"装好之后大概是这样——每个脚本是自己的小进程，坏一个不连累别人："},"564":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"Python 插件的 `pyproject.toml` 里写一段身份（`name` 是插件名，`entry` 不写就默认 `main.py`）："},"565":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"JS / TS 插件写在 `package.json` 里（`entry` 不写就默认 `index.ts`）："},"566":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"入口文件用薄 SDK 写逻辑。Python 长这样："},"567":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"TypeScript 长这样："},"568":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"薄 SDK 是**一个文件**：Python 拷 `fuyubot.py`、TS 拷 `fuyubot.ts` 进插件目录即可\n（随 FuyuBot-SDK 提供，在\n`crates/fuyubot-sdk-native/` 下）。"},"569":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#2-装进机器人","content":"整个目录被复制到 `plugins/scripts/` 下。想确认装好了："},"570":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#3-跑起来","content":"剩下的交给机器人：装依赖（Python 用 `uv sync`，JS / TS 用 `bun install`）、启动脚本、\n开始收事件。流程大致是这样："},"571":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数              | 干什么                |\n| --------------- | ------------------ |\n| `on(事件名, 处理函数)` | 订阅一个事件，来消息时你的函数被调用 |","table":"table-0"},"572":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数                    | 干什么                     |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `invoke(方法, 参数, 回调?)` | 调一次 TDLib 接口（发消息、取资料……） |","table":"table-0"},"573":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数             | 干什么                                        |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `log(消息, 级别?)` | 打日志，级别：error / warn / info / debug / trace |","table":"table-0"},"574":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数               | 干什么      |\n| ---------------- | -------- |\n| `emit(事件名, 数据?)` | 发一条自己的事件 |","table":"table-0"},"575":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数                                           | 干什么                   |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `register_tool(...)` / `use_middleware(...)` | 注册工具、挂中间件（进阶，见下文按语言页） |","table":"table-0"},"576":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数      | 干什么                  |\n| ------- | -------------------- |\n| `run()` | 握手并开始收事件。**永远放最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"577":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"`on` 收到的 `payload` 是解析好的对象 / 字典，直接取字段就行，不用自己拼 JSON。\n更多事件名与接口用法见按语言的页面："},"578":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"<Card title=\"Python 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/python/\" />"},"579":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"<Card title=\"JS 与 TypeScript 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/js-ts/\" />"},"580":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"<Card title=\"订阅与事件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/events/\" />"},"581":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                           | 机器人的反应                                  |\n| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <目录>` | 目录整个拷进 `plugins/scripts/`，下次 `run` 自动加载 |","table":"table-1"},"582":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                            | 机器人的反应          |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------- |\n| 运行中往 `plugins/scripts/` 丢一个新目录 | 约一秒内自动发现、装依赖、启动 |","table":"table-1"},"583":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的         | 机器人的反应              |\n| ----------- | ------------------- |\n| 运行中删掉一个脚本目录 | 自动停掉对应脚本（对跑着的实例也安全） |","table":"table-1"},"584":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的      | 机器人的反应              |\n| -------- | ------------------- |\n| 改了脚本里的代码 | **不**自动重启；改完重启机器人即可 |","table":"table-1"},"585":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                              | 机器人的反应    |\n| -------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <目录名>` | 删掉目录并卸载脚本 |","table":"table-1"},"586":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"**名字的两副面孔**：manifest 里的 `name`（如 `mybot.my-plugin`）是插件身份，日志里看到的是它；\n`plugin uninstall` 用的是**目录名**（`my-plugin`）。装的时候整个目录一起拷，\n`node_modules` / `.venv` / `target` 这类依赖与构建产物会被跳过——到机器人上现装。"},"587":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|     | 脚本插件（本页）            | 原生插件                   |\n| --- | ------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 写什么 | Python / JS / TS 脚本 | Rust / C / C++ 编译出的动态库 |","table":"table-2"},"588":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|      | 脚本插件（本页） | 原生插件        |\n| ---- | -------- | ----------- |\n| 要编译吗 | 不要       | 要（用你自己的工具链） |","table":"table-2"},"589":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|       | 脚本插件（本页）          | 原生插件     |\n| ----- | ----------------- | -------- |\n| 崩了会怎样 | 只有这个脚本的进程死，机器人照常跑 | 可能拖垮整个宿主 |","table":"table-2"},"590":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|     | 脚本插件（本页）      | 原生插件         |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------ |\n| 适合  | 机器人逻辑、自动化、小工具 | 高性能、要贴近宿主的场合 |","table":"table-2"},"591":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"原生插件是「一个 cdylib 一个插件」，见 插件总览。"},"592":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**脚本报「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」**：脚本进程要加载 `fuyubot_sdk_native`\n（和托管插件是同一份库）。把它放在插件目录里，或设环境变量\n`FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` 指向它的完整路径，再重启机器人。"},"593":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：Python 要装 uv，JS / TS 要装\nbun。缺了的话对应脚本起不来，日志里会有提示，但不影响机器人启动。"},"594":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**托管插件**：`plugins/` 里要有 `fuyubot_python_host` / `fuyubot_js_host`\n两个中间插件（脚本由它们托管），和内置插件放在一起。"},"595":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**插件名只允许**字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`。"},"596":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**想排查脚本**：把配置里 `[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见\n配置文件），日志会详细很多。"},"597":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"page","content":"调用 TDLib","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib"},"598":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"td_invoke、请求号与 response 通道、便捷封装"},"599":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号与 response 通道"},"600":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"方法名以 TDLib 为准"},"601":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"便捷封装：`fuyubot-simplify`"},"602":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"公开方法"},"603":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"内容与按钮"},"604":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#文本格式markdown--html-entities","content":"文本格式（Markdown / HTML）→ entities"},"605":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#参数名为什么是这几个","content":"参数名为什么是这几个"},"606":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"不挂在 `Simplify` 上的公开函数"},"607":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#返回值与简化事件","content":"返回值与简化事件"},"608":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#用法","content":"用法"},"609":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"两条时间线"},"610":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#python--js","content":"Python / JS"},"611":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"插件不直接碰 `tdjson` 库，只把请求交给宿主："},"612":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"| VTable 函数   | 输入                       | 用途     |\n| ----------- | ------------------------ | ------ |\n| `td_invoke` | 完整请求 JSON（**含 `@type`**） | 手写整份请求 |","table":"table-0"},"613":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"| VTable 函数              | 输入            | 用途                                                |\n| ---------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `td_invoke_simplified` | 方法名 + 参数 JSON | 宿主把参数补上 `@type = 方法名`（参数不是对象就整份换成 `{\"@type\": …}`） |","table":"table-0"},"614":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"| VTable 函数    | 输入                   | 用途                                                                    |\n| ------------ | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `td_execute` | 完整请求 JSON，**同步**返回响应 | 只给「不碰服务器」的方法用（`parseTextEntities` / `getTextEntities` 之类）。当场有结果、不发请求号 |","table":"table-0"},"615":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"前两个返回**请求号**（`RequestId`），不是结果。结果从响应通道回来。"},"616":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"响应负载是 TDLib 原始 JSON，宿主额外挂一个**数值型** `request_id`（来自它注入的字符串 `@extra`，\n别自己设这个字段）。"},"617":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"要等某条响应：过滤器写 `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}`。`event_type` 键只选通道，\n不参与负载匹配（见 订阅与事件）。"},"618":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"**没接 TDLib 时**（`--replay` / `--no-tdlib`）请求只留档并返回**合成请求号**（从 `1 << 48` 起），\n链路照样能测通，但永远不会真的到达 TDLib。"},"619":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"`wait_for_update` **阻塞当前线程**，`timeout_ms == 0` 表示只检查当前状态；\n返回的 `payload_json` 是宿主线程局部缓冲，只在下一次宿主调用前有效——要留就当场拷走。"},"620":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"⚠️ **TDLib 的方法名 ≠ Telegram Bot API 的方法名**。TDLib 里所有发送都是 `sendMessage`，\n内容类型靠 `input_message_content` 区分；`sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation`\n（HTTP Bot API）**在 TDLib 里不存在**。"},"621":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                                                                          |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation` | `sendMessage` + `input_message_content.@type` = `inputMessagePhoto` / `inputMessageDocument` / `inputMessageLocation` |","table":"table-1"},"622":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的     | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                       |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `message_thread_id` | `topic_id`（`{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":N}`） |","table":"table-1"},"623":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的       | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                        |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_to_message_id` | `reply_to`（`{\"@type\":\"inputMessageReplyToMessage\",\"message_id\":N}`） |","table":"table-1"},"624":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                            |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `disable_notification` / `protect_content` | `options`（`@type: messageSendOptions`）里 |","table":"table-1"},"625":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                       |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `caption`    | 在内容类型里（`inputMessageText` / `inputMessagePhoto` …） |","table":"table-1"},"626":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                             |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `parse_mode`    | 没有这个字段；`formattedText` 只有 `text` + `entities`（要标记先走 `parseTextEntities`） |","table":"table-1"},"627":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的         | 在 TDLib 里这么写         |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `file_id`（`updateFile`） | 在 **`file.id`**，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"628":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"`sendMessage` 的真签名（来自 `td_api.tl`）："},"629":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"查方法名最快的办法是问 SDK（它读的是真 `td_api.tl`）："},"630":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"`Simplify` 只简化**输入**，不改变输出：每个方法都经 `td_invoke*` 发出，原始更新照旧对插件可见。\n参数形状是**一个方法一个结构体 + 短字段名**，调用方不用拼 TDLib 的嵌套 JSON；\n文本格式（Markdown / HTML）**不自己解析**，经同步的 `td_execute` 问 TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`。\n富消息（`messageRichMessage`）是另一套参数（`RichMessageParams`），见 富消息。"},"631":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"方法名与参数名由 `every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema` 拿真 `td_api.tl` 烤出来的元数据\n（`TdApiSchema::compiled()`）逐条校验，离线就能跑。"},"632":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                          | 发出的 `@type`   | 参数结构体字段                                                                                                | 返回               |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------- |\n| `send_message(chat_id, &SendMessageParams)` | `sendMessage` | `text` / `media` / `reply_to_message_id` / `topic_id` / `reply_markup` / `link_preview` / `timeout_ms` | `RequestId`（不阻塞） |","table":"table-2"},"633":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                                       | 发出的 `@type`                        | 参数结构体字段                | 返回                            |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `send_message_wait_success(chat_id, &SendMessageParams)` | 同上，再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` | 同上（`timeout_ms` 是等待上限） | `SendConfirmation`（⚠️ **阻塞**） |","table":"table-2"},"634":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                              | 发出的 `@type`        | 参数结构体字段                                                          | 返回                                                                                                                      |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `send_message_album(chat_id, &SendAlbumParams)` | `sendMessageAlbum` | `medias`（2–10 项）/ `caption` / `reply_to_message_id` / `topic_id` | `RequestId`；项数不对返回 `SimplifyError::AlbumSize`。⚠️ **相册没有 `reply_markup`**（真签名里就没有这个参数）：想给相册挂键盘用 `editMessageReplyMarkup` |","table":"table-2"},"635":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                                        | 发出的 `@type`       | 参数结构体字段                                  | 返回          |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| `edit_message_text(chat_id, message_id, &EditTextParams)` | `editMessageText` | `text` / `link_preview` / `reply_markup` | `RequestId` |","table":"table-2"},"636":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                                              | 发出的 `@type`          | 参数结构体字段                 | 返回          |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- | ----------------------- | ----------- |\n| `edit_message_caption(chat_id, message_id, &EditCaptionParams)` | `editMessageCaption` | `text` / `reply_markup` | `RequestId` |","table":"table-2"},"637":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                                          | 发出的 `@type`        | 参数结构体字段                                 | 返回          |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| `edit_message_media(chat_id, message_id, &EditMediaParams)` | `editMessageMedia` | `text`（新内容标题）/ `media` / `reply_markup` | `RequestId` |","table":"table-2"},"638":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                     | 发出的 `@type`      | 参数结构体字段                  | 返回          |\n| -------------------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------ | ----------- |\n| `delete_message(chat_id, ids, revoke)` | `deleteMessages` | `message_ids` / `revoke` | `RequestId` |","table":"table-2"},"639":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                                  | 发出的 `@type`           | 参数结构体字段                                                         | 返回          |\n| --------------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| `answer_callback_query(query_id, text, show_alert)` | `answerCallbackQuery` | `text`（`None` → `\"\"`）/ `show_alert` / `url=\"\"` / `cache_time=0` | `RequestId` |","table":"table-2"},"640":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                 | 发出的 `@type`                              | 参数结构体字段               | 返回                        |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `formatted(&Text)` | **`parseTextEntities`（同步 `td_execute`）** | `text` / `parse_mode` | `formattedText` 的 `Value` |","table":"table-2"},"641":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                         | 发出的 `@type` | 参数结构体字段                       | 返回                                    |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ----------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `wait_for_update` / `wait_for_update_json` | 不发方法（纯订阅）   | `UpdateFilter` + `timeout_ms` | `WaitHandle` / `Option<Value>`（⚠️ 阻塞） |","table":"table-2"},"642":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                   | 发出的 `@type`             | 参数结构体字段     | 返回                     |\n| ------------------------------------ | ----------------------- | ----------- | ---------------------- |\n| `wait_response(request, timeout_ms)` | 不发方法（等 `\"response\"` 通道） | `RequestId` | `Option<Value>`（⚠️ 阻塞） |","table":"table-2"},"643":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                  | 发出的 `@type`           | 参数结构体字段         | 返回                          |\n| ----------------------------------- | --------------------- | --------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `resolve_entities(ids, timeout_ms)` | `getChat` / `getUser` | `Vec<EntityId>` | `EntitiesResolution`（⚠️ 阻塞） |","table":"table-2"},"644":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                                             | 发出的 `@type`    | 参数结构体字段 | 返回                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ------- | --------------------- |\n| `download_file(file_id, priority, timeout_ms)` | `downloadFile` | —       | `FileDownload`（⚠️ 阻塞） |","table":"table-2"},"645":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"| 方法                    | 发出的 `@type` | 参数结构体字段      | 返回   |\n| --------------------- | ----------- | ------------ | ---- |\n| `cancel_wait(handle)` | 不发          | `WaitHandle` | `()` |","table":"table-2"},"646":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"**编辑的结果去哪了**：编辑后的 `Message`、以及 `Message is not modified` 这类错误都是**响应**\n（`\"response\"` 通道，`@type == \"error\"` 表示失败）。要拿就 `wait_response(request, timeout)`。\n封装层**刻意不重试**——限流等多久是调用方的事。"},"647":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#公开方法","content":"**`send_message` 不阻塞、`send_message_wait_success` 阻塞**：等更新要靠**投递线程**送回来，\n而插件通常正是在更新回调里发消息，在回调里等就是自己卡自己，等到的是超时。"},"648":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"`Media`（对应 TDLib 的 `inputMessage*`，形状只有一份实现 `content_json`）："},"649":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"| 变体                   | 内容类型                | 必需 / 常用字段                                      |\n| -------------------- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `Media::photo(file)` | `inputMessagePhoto` | `caption` / `width` / `height` / `has_spoiler` |","table":"table-3"},"650":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"| 变体                    | 内容类型                | 必需 / 常用字段                                                              |\n| --------------------- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Media::Video { .. }` | `inputMessageVideo` | `duration` / `width` / `height` / `supports_streaming` / `has_spoiler` |","table":"table-3"},"651":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"| 变体                    | 内容类型                | 必需 / 常用字段                          |\n| --------------------- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `Media::Audio { .. }` | `inputMessageAudio` | `duration` / `title` / `performer` |","table":"table-3"},"652":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"| 变体                      | 内容类型                   | 必需 / 常用字段 |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------- | --------- |\n| `Media::document(file)` | `inputMessageDocument` | `caption` |","table":"table-3"},"653":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"| 变体                        | 内容类型                    | 必需 / 常用字段                                       |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `Media::Animation { .. }` | `inputMessageAnimation` | `duration` / `width` / `height` / `has_spoiler` |","table":"table-3"},"654":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"| 变体                      | 内容类型                  | 必需 / 常用字段                                   |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `Media::Sticker { .. }` | `inputMessageSticker` | `emoji`（**没有 caption**）/ `width` / `height` |","table":"table-3"},"655":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"| 变体                          | 内容类型                   | 必需 / 常用字段 |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------- | --------- |\n| `Media::location(lat, lng)` | `inputMessageLocation` | —         |","table":"table-3"},"656":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"`file` 一律是 `InputFile`：`InputFile::local(path)` → `inputFileLocal`，\n`InputFile::remote(id)` → `inputFileRemote`。`&str` / `String` 会被当成**本地路径**。"},"657":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"`.caption(text)` 给媒体挂标题；`SendMessageParams.text` 优先于媒体自带的 caption。"},"658":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"尺寸 / 时长填 `0` 也行（TDLib 自己读真实值）。"},"659":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"`ReplyButton`（`reply_markup` 是 `Vec<Vec<ReplyButton>>`，空 = 不带键盘）："},"660":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"| 构造                                  | 按钮类型                                                 |\n| ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `ReplyButton::callback(text, data)` | `inlineKeyboardButtonTypeCallback`（`data` 自动 base64） |","table":"table-4"},"661":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"| 构造                            | 按钮类型                          |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `ReplyButton::url(text, url)` | `inlineKeyboardButtonTypeUrl` |","table":"table-4"},"662":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"| 构造                                 | 按钮类型                           |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `ReplyButton::user(text, user_id)` | `inlineKeyboardButtonTypeUser` |","table":"table-4"},"663":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"| 构造                                | 按钮类型                             |\n| --------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `ReplyButton::web_app(text, url)` | `inlineKeyboardButtonTypeWebApp` |","table":"table-4"},"664":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#内容与按钮","content":"链式修饰：`.emoji(custom_emoji_id)`（`icon_custom_emoji_id`）、\n`.style(ButtonStyle::{Default,Primary,Danger,Success})`。"},"665":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#文本格式markdown--html-entities","content":"**没有第二套解析器**。带标记的文本经 TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities` 换成\n`formattedText { text, entities }`——语法以 TDLib 为准，我们只负责把请求送进去。"},"666":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#文本格式markdown--html-entities","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`                                   |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Plain`（默认） | **不发请求**，直接 `formattedText { text, entities: [] }` |","table":"table-5"},"667":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#文本格式markdown--html-entities","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`                                |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `Markdown`  | `{\"@type\":\"textParseModeMarkdown\",\"version\":1}` |","table":"table-5"},"668":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#文本格式markdown--html-entities","content":"| `ParseMode`  | 发出的 `parse_mode`                                |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `MarkdownV2` | `{\"@type\":\"textParseModeMarkdown\",\"version\":2}` |","table":"table-5"},"669":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#文本格式markdown--html-entities","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`                |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `Html`      | `{\"@type\":\"textParseModeHTML\"}` |","table":"table-5"},"670":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#文本格式markdown--html-entities","content":"快捷方式：`Text::plain/markdown/markdown_v2/html`，`&str` / `String` → 纯文本。"},"671":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#文本格式markdown--html-entities","content":"⚠️ **真库实测（TDLib 1.8.68，1.8.66 同结论）：MarkdownV2 的粗体是 `*x*`，不是 `**x**`。**\n`**bold**` 会被吞成 `bold` 并且**不给** bold entity，`__x__` 出来是下划线。别按 CommonMark 的直觉写\n——这正是「不自己实现解析」的理由。"},"672":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#文本格式markdown--html-entities","content":"**为什么走同步的 `td_execute`**：`parseTextEntities` 不碰服务器，TDLib 允许同步跑它。等响应那套会把\n**投递线程**卡住（插件通常正是在更新回调里发消息，响应又要靠同一个线程投递），同步调用没有这个问题。\n拿不到结果（没接 TDLib、TDLib 报错）就退回纯文本并打一条 `Warn` 日志。"},"673":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#参数名为什么是这几个","content":"真 `td_api.tl`：`sendMessage chat_id topic_id reply_to options reply_markup input_message_content`\n——**没有** `message_thread_id` / `reply_to_message_id` / 顶层 `disable_notification`（那是 Bot API\n的名字），也**没有**顶层 `caption`（它在内容类型里）。短名字到 TDLib 字段的映射只有一处实现："},"674":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段        | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                        |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `topic_id: i64` | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":…}` |","table":"table-6"},"675":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                   | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                         |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_to_message_id: i64` | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\":\"inputMessageReplyToMessage\",\"message_id\":…}` |","table":"table-6"},"676":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                              | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                      |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_markup: Vec<Vec<ReplyButton>>` | `reply_markup` = `{\"@type\":\"replyMarkupInlineKeyboard\",\"rows\":…}` |","table":"table-6"},"677":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                    | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                               |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `link_preview: Some(false)` | `inputMessageText.link_preview_options.is_disabled = true` |","table":"table-6"},"678":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                 | 落到的 TDLib 字段                           |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| `text` / `media.caption` | `formattedText`（经 `parseTextEntities`） |","table":"table-6"},"679":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                                                | 作用                          |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `send_params` / `album_params` / `edit_text_params` / `edit_caption_params` / `edit_media_params` | 组装参数，**不含 `@type`**（那是宿主补的） |","table":"table-7"},"680":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                             | 作用                         |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `content_json(&Media, render)` | 媒体 → `InputMessageContent` |","table":"table-7"},"681":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                          | 作用                                        |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `parse_text_request(&Text)` | `parseTextEntities` 的请求；`Plain` 返回 `None` |","table":"table-7"},"682":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                 | 作用                            |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `formatted_from(&Text, Option<&Value>)` / `is_formatted_text(...)` | 响应 → `formattedText`；拿不到退回纯文本 |","table":"table-7"},"683":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                  | 作用                                  |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `plain_text(&Text)` | 纯文本 → `formattedText`（不花往返），也是默认渲染器 |","table":"table-7"},"684":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                               | 作用                                                                                       |\n| -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `command_of(&Value)` → `Command` | 从 `updateNewMessage` 解出 `chat_id` / `message_id` / `name` / `args` / `text`；跳过自己发的、非文本消息 |","table":"table-7"},"685":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                             | 作用                                           |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `on_command(host, 闭包)` → `CommandSubscription` | 订阅 `updateNewMessage`，每条命令调一次闭包；**drop 即退订** |","table":"table-7"},"686":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#返回值与简化事件","content":"| 类型                 | 字段                                                                    |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `SendConfirmation` | `request_id`、`confirmed`、`update`（`update.message` 就是最终消息；超时是 `Null`） |","table":"table-8"},"687":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#返回值与简化事件","content":"| 类型             | 字段                                                                                         |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `FileDownload` | `request_id`、`file_id`、`completed`、`last_update`（取自 `file.local.is_downloading_completed`） |","table":"table-8"},"688":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#返回值与简化事件","content":"| 类型                   | 字段                                                                                          |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `EntitiesResolution` | `request_id`、`entities: Vec<EntityResult>`；`to_json()` 给出 `{\"request_id\":…,\"entities\":[…]}` |","table":"table-8"},"689":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#返回值与简化事件","content":"| 类型             | 字段                                 |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `EntityResult` | `id`、`request`、`value`（超时是 `Null`） |","table":"table-8"},"690":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#返回值与简化事件","content":"| 类型              | 字段                                                                    |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `SimplifyError` | `Abi(AbiError)`、`BadString`（参数串含 NUL）、`AlbumSize(usize)`（相册不是 2–10 项） |","table":"table-8"},"691":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#返回值与简化事件","content":"`Simplify` 顺带推两条简化事件（不想用就订阅原始 `@type`，两者不冲突）："},"692":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#返回值与简化事件","content":"| 事件                  | 谁发                    | 负载                              |\n| ------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `entities_resolved` | `resolve_entities` 末尾 | `EntitiesResolution::to_json()` |","table":"table-9"},"693":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#返回值与简化事件","content":"| 事件              | 谁发                                 | 负载                                                                  |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `file_progress` | `download_file` 每收到一条 `updateFile` | `{\"file_id\":…,\"completed\":…,\"downloaded_size\":…,\"expected_size\":…}` |","table":"table-9"},"694":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#用法","content":"便捷封装的方法名 / 字段路径是按真 `td_api.tl` 拼的，并有离线测试拿\n`TdApiSchema::check_request` 逐条校验；Markdown → entities 的真库行为另有一条 `-- --ignored` 测试。\n但「真 Telegram 认不认这些值」要真账号才验得了。"},"695":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`td_invoke*` 返回的是**请求号**，真正的 JSON 从 `\"response\"` 通道回来\n（事件类型 `RESPONSE_EVENT`，只发给发起请求的那个插件）。"},"696":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`WaitHandle::payload_json` / `td_execute` 的返回串都是宿主临时的**线程局部缓冲**，\n只在下一次宿主调用之前有效。要拿数据就立刻读，或者用 `*_json` / `wait_response`（它们已经替你拷好了）。"},"697":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-99","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`HostRuntime::td_send` 在**没接 TDLib** 时只留档 + 发合成请求号（从 `1 << 48` 起），`td_execute` 在同样\n情况下返回 `None`——所以本文的每个方法在离线状态下都能被跑通、但不会真的到达 TDLib（Markdown 会退回纯文本）。"},"698":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-100","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#python--js","content":"脚本里的 `invoke` 有第三参数 `on_response`，按 `request_id` 自动配对，脚本不用自己记请求号："},"699":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"page","content":"调试与安装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing"},"700":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"回放验证、静态检查、装进插件目录"},"701":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"静态检查：`fuyubot-sdk check`"},"702":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放：不接账号也能验插件"},"703":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"安装"},"704":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"装完还是不响？"},"705":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"插件出问题通常不是「代码写得不对」，而是「没被加载」「加载了但没订阅上」「订阅了但请求拼错」。\n这三步各有对应的工具，全都不需要 Telegram 账号。"},"706":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                       | 干什么                  | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot-sdk check <产物>` | **静态**读导出符号，不 dlopen | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"707":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                          | 干什么                   | 需要账号吗 |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot run --replay <文件>` | 把一批更新灌进管线后退出，不接 TDLib | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"708":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                            | 干什么              | 需要账号吗 |\n| ----------------------------- | ---------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <路径>` | 复制产物（＋脚本同伴）进插件目录 | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"709":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                    | 干什么                 | 需要账号吗 |\n| --------------------- | ------------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot plugin list` | 真的加载一次，看插件名与 ABI 版本 | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"710":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令            | 干什么     | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot run` | 真登录、真更新 | 是     |","table":"table-0"},"711":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"**非零退出 = 宿主会拒绝加载**（缺必需的 `plugin_init`，或根本不是动态库），可以进 CI。"},"712":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"它**不加载、不运行**：走 `object` 解析 PE / ELF / Mach-O 的导出表，不碰 `dlopen`\n（`dlopen` 会在宿主进程里跑插件的初始化代码，那已经算「加载」了）。"},"713":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"因此它**看不到 ABI 版本**——版本是 `plugin_init` 的**返回值**，不是符号。它只会如实报\n「只能运行时判定」，不编一个看起来可信的结论。"},"714":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放把文件里的更新（单个对象或对象数组）灌进六阶段管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号**，\n插件发出的请求只留档不发。输出三样东西："},"715":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"每条更新的 `UpdateOutcome`："},"716":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件打的日志（`HostRuntime::log_lines`，上限 256 行）；"},"717":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件发出去的请求：`#请求号 方法名 参数`。"},"718":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数              | 说明             |\n| --------------- | -------------- |\n| `--replay <文件>` | 要回放的更新；对象或对象数组 |","table":"table-1"},"719":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                  | 说明                                         |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖插件目录（默认取 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `plugins.dir`） |","table":"table-1"},"720":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                   | 说明                                           |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `--replay-wait <MS>` | 回放后的静默窗口；不填时脚本插件 2000ms、纯原生插件 150ms（上限 60 秒） |","table":"table-1"},"721":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"脚本插件在**另一个进程**里跑，反应要经管道回来，还可能捎带网络请求——窗口太短会把最终答复漏掉。"},"722":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放**故意不接 TDLib**：它要在任何机器上离线可跑，接了就要账号与网络。\n所以回放能证明「插件收到更新后做出了正确判断、发出了正确请求」，**不能**证明真 Telegram 认这些参数。"},"723":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"传**工程目录**时会把旁边的 `.py` / `.js` / `.ts` / `.pyi` 一起拷；传单个 dll 时看不到脚本在哪，\n**脚本插件请传工程目录**。"},"724":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"`plugin install <工程目录>` 只看 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` 与工程目录本身。若插件是**当前\nworkspace 的成员**（本仓的 `examples/*`），`cargo build -p <crate>` 的产物默认落在仓库根 `target/`，\n于是它找不到——加 `--target-dir <工程目录>/target`，或直接指着产物装。"},"725":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状                          | 先看                                                              |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `check` 报 `[缺] plugin_init` | crate 是不是 `crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]`；C++ 的四个符号在不在 `extern \"C\"` 里 |","table":"table-2"},"726":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                      |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 日志里有「跳过 xxx」 | ABI 版本不匹配，或 `dlopen` 失败（缺兄弟 DLL：把依赖放在插件旁边，加载器会先查库自己的目录） |","table":"table-2"},"727":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                      |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| 加载了但一条事件都没收到 | 订阅句柄是不是被 drop 了（Rust 侧 `let _ =` 会立刻退订） |","table":"table-2"},"728":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状      | 先看                                                                                                               |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本插件起不来 | manifest 身份段（`[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"`）与 `entry` 对不对；`run()` 是不是最后一行；`uv` / `bun` 在不在；原生桥库找不找得到（见 脚本插件常见问题） |","table":"table-2"},"729":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                    |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 请求发出去了但没收到响应 | 回放里本来就不会有响应（请求只留档）；真环境下等的是 `\"response\"` 通道，见 调用 TDLib |","table":"table-2"},"730":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"要查 TDLib 的方法名与参数名，用 `fuyubot-sdk td-methods --filter <片段>` / `td-method <名字>`；\n契约与所有权规则见 ABI 契约。"},"731":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"page","content":"工具与中间件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools"},"732":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"注册工具元数据、call_tool、六阶段洋葱管线"},"733":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"注册工具：只登记元数据"},"734":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具走注册表","content":"调用工具：走注册表"},"735":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"中间件：六阶段洋葱"},"736":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"工具（tool）是「有名字、有 schema、可被别的插件或宿主调用」的能力；中间件（middleware）\n是流经更新管线时的洋葱式拦截点。两者的注册都记在**当前插件的作用域**下：\n插件卸载（或加载失败）时宿主一次性回滚这批注册。"},"737":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"本版 ABI **只登记元数据**：`register_tool` 收的是一份 JSON 描述，里面没有函数指针的位置，\n登记出来的工具一律是 `handler: None` 的**声明型工具**。插件无法让宿主回调进自己来执行工具。"},"738":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"| 字段     | 类型     | 说明                |\n| ------ | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `name` | string | 全局唯一，建议 `插件名.工具名` |","table":"table-0"},"739":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"| 字段        | 类型     | 说明                |\n| --------- | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `version` | string | semver，默认 `0.1.0` |","table":"table-0"},"740":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"| 字段            | 类型     | 说明      |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------- |\n| `description` | string | 给人看的一句话 |","table":"table-0"},"741":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"| 字段             | 类型          | 说明   |\n| -------------- | ----------- | ---- |\n| `input_schema` | JSON Schema | 描述入参 |","table":"table-0"},"742":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"| 字段              | 类型          | 说明                  |\n| --------------- | ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `output_schema` | JSON Schema | `null` / `{}` 表示不校验 |","table":"table-0"},"743":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"| 字段                     | 类型       | 说明        |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | --------- |\n| `required_permissions` | string[] | 调用前要过的权限门 |","table":"table-0"},"744":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"| 字段           | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ---- | ---------- |\n| `idempotent` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"745":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"| 字段           | 类型     | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ------ | ---------- |\n| `timeout_ms` | number | 默认 `30000` |","table":"table-0"},"746":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------- |\n| `is_async` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"747":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明                     |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------------------- |\n| `callable` | bool | **读出时才有**：本进程里有没有可调处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"748":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具只登记元数据","content":"`handle` 无效（`id == 0`）表示登记被拒（重名、schema 不合法等）。"},"749":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具走注册表","content":"`call_tool(name, input_json)` 返回**请求号**（和 `td_invoke*` 一样，不是结果）。宿主把它交给\n`ToolRegistry::call_tool`，顺序是："},"750":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具走注册表","content":"本版 ABI 登记的工具没有处理器，所以对**这类**工具调 `call_tool` 只会拿到**无效请求号**\n（`id == 0`）——声明型工具的用途是「让它出现在 `list_tools` 里、被别人发现」，不是被真的执行。"},"751":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具走注册表","content":"`list_tools()` 返回全部工具的元数据 JSON 数组。**宿主线程局部缓冲**：读完即弃，\n要留就当场拷走，**不要试图释放它**。"},"752":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具走注册表","content":"脚本侧的名字不同：Python 是 `host.register_tool(...)`，JS 是 `host.registerTool(...)`，\n都只收 `name` / `description` / `input_schema`。"},"753":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段          | 数值  | 谁跑它       |\n| ----------- | --- | --------- |\n| `PreUpdate` | 0   | 收到更新、还没解析 |","table":"table-1"},"754":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它             |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------- |\n| `PreRoute` | 1   | 已解析 `@type`，路由前 |","table":"table-1"},"755":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `InPlugin` | 2   | 分发给监听器之前；**一条更新只跑一遍** |","table":"table-1"},"756":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它    |\n| -------------- | --- | ------ |\n| `PostResponse` | 3   | 响应发出之后 |","table":"table-1"},"757":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段            | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ------------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `PreToolCall` | 4   | 工具调用之前（**目前没有生产调用方**） |","table":"table-1"},"758":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它        |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------- |\n| `PostToolCall` | 5   | 工具调用之后（同上） |","table":"table-1"},"759":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"数值就是 ABI 里的 `stage` 参数，与 `fuyubot-middleware::Stage` 一一对应。"},"760":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"要点："},"761":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**回调是 `C-unwind` 的** `fn(user_data, stage: u32, payload_json) -> i32`：返回 `0` 继续、**非 0 中断本阶段**。\n中断只影响**本阶段剩下的层**，管线继续走下一阶段（已经改过的负载照样往下传），宿主记一条 warning。"},"762":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**中间件一条更新跑一遍，不是每个监听器跑一遍**：`InPlugin` 的产出就是所有监听器看到的版本。\n按监听器各跑一遍的话，第 N 个会看到被改过 N 次的负载。"},"763":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"洋葱模型：进入段在「继续往下」之前，退出段在之后。不往下走就是中断。"},"764":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"Rust 侧注册返回的 `MiddlewareHandle` 也是 `#[must_use]`，drop 即摘除。"},"765":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"阶段号非法或回调为空会让 `use_middleware` 直接返回无效句柄（不会静默挂个空层）。"},"766":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"想看订阅与双通道怎么配合，见 订阅与事件；工具调用的格式最终由宿主层决定，\n契约本身见 ABI 契约。"},"767":{"id":"/docs/usage/build","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"page","content":"从源码构建","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build"},"768":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build","content":"开发者路线：自己编 fuyubot 与 fuyubot-sdk"},"769":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"前置"},"770":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"构建"},"771":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"编出来的东西在哪"},"772":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#发布包是怎么出的","content":"发布包是怎么出的"},"773":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#自检","content":"自检"},"774":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build","content":"普通用户请走 下载与安装——发布包里有可执行文件和 `tdjson`，不用编译。\n这一页是给要改代码、或者平台没有发布包（比如 Intel Mac）的人。"},"775":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置   | 要求                    |\n| ---- | --------------------- |\n| Rust | 1.99+（`edition 2024`） |","table":"table-0"},"776":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置      | 要求                               |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Windows | MSVC 工具链（Rust / C / C++ 插件都用它链接） |","table":"table-0"},"777":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置   | 要求                   |\n| ---- | -------------------- |\n| 构建输入 | 一份 `td_api.tl`（下面说明） |","table":"table-0"},"778":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置  | 要求                           |\n| --- | ---------------------------- |\n| 运行期 | `tdjson` 动态库（构建期会被拷到可执行文件同级） |","table":"table-0"},"779":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**：`fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs` 无条件去拿它——`TDLIB_TD_API_TL`（显式指定，优先级最高）→ 缓存 → 从 GitHub Releases 下载，拿不到就让**构建失败**。缓存根顺序：`FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` → `$CARGO_HOME/fuyubot-tdlib-vendored` → 项目本地 `<工作区>/.tdlib-cache`。仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已把最后一档指好，在仓库里敲命令不用先 export。"},"780":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"转换在**编译期**完成，构建日志里只有一条 `已转换 …\\td_api.tl：共 N 条`。条数取决于构建时用的那份文件（本机三千多条），**不是常量**，别当断言用。"},"781":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"`tdjson` 是**运行时**动态加载的，编译期不依赖它存在——所以构建成功不代表运行找得到。构建期 `fuyubot-tdlib/build.rs` 会把它（连同那个目录里的兄弟 DLL）拷到可执行文件同级目录，`target/debug/fuyubot.exe` 拷走就能跑。唯一例外是 `cargo install` 装出来的二进制：安装目录不受构建脚本管，tdjson 得自己放。"},"782":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令                           | 产物                         | 说明  |\n| ---------------------------- | -------------------------- | --- |\n| `cargo build -p fuyubot-cli` | `target\\debug\\fuyubot.exe` | 开发用 |","table":"table-1"},"783":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令                  | 产物                           | 说明                  |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `cargo package-bot` | `target\\release\\fuyubot.exe` | 本地打包（tdjson 已在同级目录） |","table":"table-1"},"784":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令                  | 产物                               | 说明                   |\n| ------------------- | -------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `cargo package-sdk` | `target\\release\\fuyubot-sdk.exe` | 给插件作者，**不需要** tdjson |","table":"table-1"},"785":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令          | 产物  | 说明                    |\n| ----------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `cargo bot` | —   | 一键 `fuyubot run` 当前目录 |","table":"table-1"},"786":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"本文档其余页面里的 `fuyubot` / `fuyubot.exe` 指的就是这些产物；从发布包安装的用户手里就是解压出来的那个。"},"787":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#发布包是怎么出的","content":"`.github/workflows/release-bot.yml` 在 `v*` tag 上按平台编 `fuyubot`、三个内置插件与 `fuyubot-sdk`，\n**分开**打三份中间包（本体 / 插件 / SDK），`publish` 再把本体 + 内置插件叠成各平台一个 zip：\n解压得到 `<资产名>/`，里面有可执行文件、该平台的 `tdjson`（从 `TDLib-v<版本>` 那个 Release 取）\n和 `plugins/`。SDK 是单独的 `fuyubot-sdk-<系统>-<架构>.zip`。\n名字与 `crates/fuyubot-tdlib/src/loader/vendored.rs` 的 `ASSETS` 表同一套口径（`x86_64` / `aarch64`），\n加平台时两边一起加。"},"788":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#自检","content":"真 TDLib 的端到端自检（要本机的 `tdjson`）："},"789":{"id":"/docs/usage/config","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"page","content":"配置文件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config"},"790":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"fuyubot.toml 的字段与默认值"},"791":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"字段"},"792":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"几条约定"},"793":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"改了配置怎么生效"},"794":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"`fuyubot run` 读 `fuyubot.toml`，**所有键都有默认值**。缺这个文件时 `run` 会按模板自动生成一份（等价于先跑一次 `fuyubot init`）——`--replay` 是例外，它不会为了回放在你的目录里留配置。"},"795":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"一个项目目录长这样："},"796":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键            | 默认值       | 它决定什么                     |\n| ------------ | --------- | ------------------------- |\n| `[bot].name` | `fuyubot` | 显示名（启动那行、`status` 里的「名字」） |","table":"table-0"},"797":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键              | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                             |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[bot].api_id` | `0` | **旧位置**；`[telegram].api_id` 优先。新配置写进 `[telegram]` |","table":"table-0"},"798":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                         | 默认值   | 它决定什么                                                         |\n| ------------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[telegram].account_type` | `bot` | 登录走哪条路：`bot` → Bot Token；`user` → 手机号 / 扫码。**写错报错**，不会静默当 bot |","table":"table-0"},"799":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                   | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                                     |\n| ------------------- | --- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[telegram].api_id` | `0` | TDLib api_id（到 my.telegram.org 申请）。不是秘密；`0` = 没配，`run` 会问 |","table":"table-0"},"800":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                     | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                      |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `[telegram].data_dir` | `data` | TDLib 的数据目录：database 与 files **都**指它。相对项目根 |","table":"table-0"},"801":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键               | 默认值       | 它决定什么                                                     |\n| --------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[plugins].dir` | `plugins` | `run` 从这里加载插件（动态库 + `scripts/` 下的脚本插件）；`--plugin-dir` 覆盖它 |","table":"table-0"},"802":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                     | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                                                        |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[plugins].log_level` | `info` | 插件日志的最低级别：error / warn / info / debug / trace。排查插件时调成 `\"debug\"`；**写错级别名会报错** |","table":"table-0"},"803":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键              | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                          |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `[tdlib].path` | 空   | 留空 = 按四级优先级自动找 tdjson；指定时给 tdjson 的**目录**或文件路径 |","table":"table-0"},"804":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                       | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `[tdlib].log_verbosity` | `1` | TDLib 日志详细度。TDLib 自己的默认更啰嗦（每轮 `td_receive` 的超时都打到 stderr）；负数按 0 处理 |","table":"table-0"},"805":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"模板（`fuyubot init` 生成的就是它）："},"806":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"**凭据一律不落盘**：`api_hash`、Bot Token、手机号、验证码、两步验证密码都不许写进配置文件（连日志也不行）。`api_hash` 在配置里**根本没有字段**，写了也会被 serde 忽略——它只认环境变量 `TG_API_HASH` 或 `fuyubot run` 的交互式输入。session 由 TDLib 自己落在 `data_dir`，配置里不记任何登录态。"},"807":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"**相对路径相对配置文件所在目录**（也就是项目根）：`plugins`、`data`、日志目录都按它解析。"},"808":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"**自动 init 只认默认文件名**：缺 `fuyubot.toml` 时 `run` 会生成一份；但用 `--config 别的名字` 时不会凭空造，直接报错。"},"809":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"`status` / `stop` **不替你造配置**：找不到 `fuyubot.toml` 就报「先 `fuyubot init` 建一个」——面对的是已经存在的实例，凭空建一个只会更迷惑。"},"810":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"`--plugin-dir` 覆盖 `[plugins].dir`，`--config` 换配置文件本身。"},"811":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"想知道**某一行到底生效成了什么**（含默认值）：`fuyubot config` 直接打出来，见 `fuyubot` 命令参考。"},"812":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"字段读出来后，运行参数（凭据来源、加载顺序）见 运行与实例管理；`account_type` 之外没有别的自定义登录入口。"},"813":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"配置在 `run` 启动时读一次。改完要重启实例："},"814":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"`--replay` 不占单实例锁，所以它可以和跑着的实例并存、跑完就退，适合改插件期间反复试。"},"815":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"改完先别急着重启：`fuyubot config --config demo\\fuyubot.toml` 会打印生效值，`account_type` 之类写错时当场就能看出来（那一行是 `⚠️` 开头，而 `run` 要走到登录才报）。"},"816":{"id":"/docs/usage/env","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"page","content":"环境变量","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env"},"817":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"每个变量的读取者与作用"},"818":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"构建期 vs 运行期"},"819":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"凭据"},"820":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"只在自动 init 那一次生效"},"821":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                | 谁读                                    | 作用                                 |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `TDLIB_TD_API_TL` | `fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs`（**构建期**） | 显式指定 `td_api.tl`，优先级最高（完全离线构建就这么干） |","table":"table-0"},"822":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                             | 谁读                     | 作用                                                                         |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` | 两个 `build.rs`（**构建期**） | 缓存根：`td_api.tl` 与 vendored 动态库都放这儿。**必须绝对路径**（build.rs 的 CWD 是各自的 crate 根） |","table":"table-0"},"823":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                            | 谁读                  | 作用                                                                        |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_RELEASES_REPO` | `build.rs`（**构建期**） | 覆盖 `[package.metadata.fuyubot] releases-repo`（默认 `CatMoeCircle/Fuyu-Bot`） |","table":"table-0"},"824":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                  | 谁读           | 作用                                 |\n| ------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` | 加载器（**运行期**） | tdjson 的目录或文件，查找优先级 1；嫌四级排查麻烦就直接设它 |","table":"table-0"},"825":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量          | 谁读            | 作用                                  |\n| ----------- | ------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `TG_API_ID` | `fuyubot run` | TDLib api_id（**不是**秘密）。也顺手带进自动生成的配置 |","table":"table-0"},"826":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量            | 谁读                   | 作用                           |\n| ------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `TG_API_HASH` | `fuyubot run` / 集成测试 | api_hash，**凭据**。只认环境变量或交互式输入 |","table":"table-0"},"827":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量             | 谁读                   | 作用                                    |\n| -------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `TG_BOT_TOKEN` | `fuyubot run` / 集成测试 | bot 账号的 token；有值就不问 Bot Token，后台运行也能登 |","table":"table-0"},"828":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量             | 谁读                     | 作用                                  |\n| -------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_NAME` | `fuyubot run` 的自动 init | 自动生成配置时的 `[bot].name`（默认 `fuyubot`） |","table":"table-0"},"829":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                 | 谁读                 | 作用                                                                                                                     |\n| ------------------ | ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH` | `fuyubot-sdk init` | **可选**：指向 SDK 仓库里放着 crate 的目录（`crates/`）。设了生成的插件用 `path = …` 对着源码开发；不设就写 crates.io 版本号（`fuyubot-plugin-api = \"0.1.0\"`） |","table":"table-0"},"830":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"**`FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` 只在构建期读。** 运行期用的是构建时烤进二进制的路径（`cargo:rustc-env` 写进去的 `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_DIR`——那是构建产物，不是让你设的变量）。运行时动态库最终由加载器的四级优先级决定，**不读** `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE`。"},"831":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"缓存根是一串候选，顺序即优先级："},"832":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"前两档写不进去时会退到项目本地那档；**全都写不进去**才退到 `$OUT_DIR`——那个目录每次重跑构建脚本都会被清空，于是下次构建会重新下载（构建脚本会明确警告）。仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已经把项目本地那档指好了。"},"833":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"**凭据一律不落盘**：`api_hash`、Bot Token、手机号、验证码、两步验证密码不得写进仓库任何文件、`fuyubot.toml`、测试夹具或日志。只允许两个来源——**环境变量**（上表那几个）与**交互式输入**（`fuyubot run` 问）。"},"834":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"`api_id` **不是**凭据，写进配置没问题（`[telegram].api_id`）。"},"835":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"`api_hash` 在配置里根本没有字段；写了也被忽略，运行时会改用 `TG_API_HASH` 或提问。"},"836":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"后台运行没有 stdin：没有 session、也没 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 时会直接失败，先把前台 `run` 登一次。"},"837":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"`FUYUBOT_NAME` 与 `TG_API_ID` 只在 `run` **自动生成配置**时被读（缺 `fuyubot.toml`，或 `--config` 指向默认文件名而它不存在）。配置已存在就不参与——否则每次跑都会覆盖你手写的名字。"},"838":{"id":"/docs/usage","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"page","content":"下载与安装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage"},"839":{"id":"/docs/usage-0","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage","content":"下载对应平台的包，解压就能跑"},"840":{"id":"/docs/usage-1","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"下载哪个包"},"841":{"id":"/docs/usage-2","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"解压、验证"},"842":{"id":"/docs/usage-3","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#起一个-bot-项目","content":"起一个 bot 项目"},"843":{"id":"/docs/usage-4","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"跑起来"},"844":{"id":"/docs/usage-5","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"不接账号先验一遍"},"845":{"id":"/docs/usage-6","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#目录布局","content":"目录布局"},"846":{"id":"/docs/usage-7","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"下一步"},"847":{"id":"/docs/usage-8","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage","content":"不用装 Rust、不用编译：到 Releases 下对应平台的 zip，\n解压后里面就是可执行文件，**TDLib 动态库已经和它放在同一个目录**（运行时按「可执行文件所在目录」\n自动找到，不用配环境变量、不用单独装 TDLib），内置插件在同级的 `plugins/`。"},"848":{"id":"/docs/usage-9","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"资产名是 **`fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`**（例：`fuyubot-v0.1.0-windows-x86_64.zip`）：\n`<版本>` 就是 Release 版本号，带在名字里方便一眼看出下的是哪个；`<OS>` = windows / linux / macos，\n`<平台>` = x86_64 / aarch64（cargo 口径，和 TDLib 自己的资产同序）。"},"849":{"id":"/docs/usage-10","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                 | 资产                                | 包里有什么                                                    |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Windows 10/11（x64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-windows-x86_64.zip` | `fuyubot.exe` + `tdjson.dll` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"850":{"id":"/docs/usage-11","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                | 资产                                 | 包里有什么                                                    |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Windows 11（ARM64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-windows-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot.exe` + `tdjson.dll` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"851":{"id":"/docs/usage-12","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统            | 资产                              | 包里有什么                                                  |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Linux（x86_64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-linux-x86_64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.so` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"852":{"id":"/docs/usage-13","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统           | 资产                               | 包里有什么                                                  |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Linux（ARM64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-linux-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.so` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"853":{"id":"/docs/usage-14","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                   | 资产                               | 包里有什么                                                     |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| macOS（Apple Silicon） | `fuyubot-<版本>-macos-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.dylib` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"854":{"id":"/docs/usage-15","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"**解压出来就是本体**：zip 里没有额外的一层目录，建议先建一个空目录再往里解压。"},"855":{"id":"/docs/usage-16","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"归档一律 `.zip`（Windows 资源管理器双击就能解，Linux / macOS 用 `unzip`）。"},"856":{"id":"/docs/usage-17","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"**上面没有的平台**（Intel Mac 等）暂时没有包，自己编：见 从源码构建。"},"857":{"id":"/docs/usage-18","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"插件开发 CLI（`fuyubot-sdk`）在**另一个仓库**的 Release 里：\nFuyuBot-SDK 的 `fuyubot-sdk-<系统>-<架构>.zip`，\n它**不需要** `tdjson`。"},"858":{"id":"/docs/usage-19","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"先建一个空目录再解压（zip 里没有套层目录，直接解到当前目录会把文件摊开）："},"859":{"id":"/docs/usage-20","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"Linux / macOS："},"860":{"id":"/docs/usage-21","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"macOS 从网上下载的二进制会被 Gatekeeper 拦住，解一次隔离属性："},"861":{"id":"/docs/usage-22","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"`--version` 能打印版本号，说明这个可执行文件本身没坏；真正加载 TDLib 是在 `run` 的时候\n（日志里会有一行 `TDLib 1.8.68 命中「可执行文件所在目录」`）。加载失败按\n常见问题 排查。"},"862":{"id":"/docs/usage-23","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#起一个-bot-项目","content":"`api_id` 到 my.telegram.org 申请，**它不是秘密**，可以直接写进配置；`api_hash` 是凭据，\n不落盘——只认环境变量 `TG_API_HASH` 或运行时的交互式输入（见 配置文件）。"},"863":{"id":"/docs/usage-24","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"真账号的最后一环**没有端到端验过**：`run` 会问凭据、驱动授权状态机、`getMe` 打印账户，然后才开分发；\n真库上的登录与 session 复用是在 `fuyubot-tdlib` 的 `-- --ignored` 自检里验的，但「收真更新 → 插件回一条」\n还没有真账号证据。想先确认插件行为，用下面的 `--replay` 或 `--no-login`。"},"864":{"id":"/docs/usage-25","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"**没有插件也能起**（「插件 0 个」），插件是后装的：拿到编好的 `.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib` 之后"},"865":{"id":"/docs/usage-26","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"插件怎么编见 插件总览。"},"866":{"id":"/docs/usage-27","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"回放是**离线**的：把一批更新 JSON 灌进整条管线，请求只留档、不发到 Telegram。先写一条最小的回放文件："},"867":{"id":"/docs/usage-28","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"退出码 0 表示回放成功。细节（`--replay-wait`、脚本插件要等静默窗口）见 离线回放。"},"868":{"id":"/docs/usage-29","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#目录布局","content":"`fuyubot init` 建出来的项目："},"869":{"id":"/docs/usage-30","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"配置文件\" href=\"/docs/usage/config/\" />"},"870":{"id":"/docs/usage-31","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"运行与实例管理\" href=\"/docs/usage/run/\" />"},"871":{"id":"/docs/usage-32","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"离线回放\" href=\"/docs/usage/replay/\" />"},"872":{"id":"/docs/usage-33","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"CLI 参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/\" />"},"873":{"id":"/docs/usage-34","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"常见问题\" href=\"/docs/usage/troubleshooting/\" />"},"874":{"id":"/docs/usage-35","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"从源码构建\" href=\"/docs/usage/build/\" />"},"875":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"page","content":"离线回放","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay"},"876":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"不接账号验证插件"},"877":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"输出里看什么"},"878":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"慢插件与脚本插件：`--replay-wait`"},"879":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"插件目录别指 `target\\debug`"},"880":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"与实例的关系"},"881":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"`fuyubot run --replay` 把一批更新的 JSON 灌进整条管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号**，用来在任何机器上验插件。"},"882":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"**每条 update 打一行**，`listeners` 是收到它的订阅数。退出码 0 表示回放成功，非零表示插件加载或回放本身失败。"},"883":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落                                 | 含义                                   |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `回放 <@type> → UpdateOutcome { … }` | 管线跑完一条更新的结果。`warnings` 非空说明有阶段或回调抱怨过 |","table":"table-0"},"884":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落          | 含义                                                     |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `插件打出来的日志：` | 插件 `log` 的原样回显（`Info mybot: init` / `start()` 是插件生命周期） |","table":"table-0"},"885":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落          | 含义                                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `插件发出去的请求：` | 插件请求的**留档**。回放不连 Telegram，所以请求不会真的发出去 |","table":"table-0"},"886":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"回放是离线路径，所以插件发请求只留档、也不会等响应——要验「响应回到插件」用真 TDLib，并准备好账号。"},"887":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"回放完不是立刻退出，而是等一个**安静窗口**再看结果（脚本插件的反应是异步的）。窗口的默认值按插件形态自动选："},"888":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"| 插件形态                       | 默认窗口    |\n| -------------------------- | ------- |\n| 有脚本（`.py` / `.js` / `.ts`） | 2000 ms |","table":"table-1"},"889":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"| 插件形态                | 默认窗口   |\n| ------------------- | ------ |\n| 纯原生（Rust / C / C++） | 150 ms |","table":"table-1"},"890":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"插件要发慢速网络请求就把它调大："},"891":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"`--plugin-dir` 要指向「只放你要验的插件」的目录。指 `target\\debug` 会混进所有示例产物：其中 `counter.dll` 是**脚本插件**，脚本不在它旁边，于是 Node 报 `Cannot find module '...\\counter.ts'`，并且**整个回放以非零码中止**。"},"892":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"正确做法是 `plugin install` 到一个干净目录，或把 dll + 脚本一起拷进去："},"893":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"`--replay` **不占单实例锁、不发布状态**：同一个目录可以一边跑着实例、一边回放。它也**不会自动 init**（回放不该因为你试了一次就在当前目录留下 `fuyubot.toml`），没有配置就按默认值跑，也不碰 `.fuyubot/` 里的实例状态。"},"894":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"回放**不接 TDLib**（无论有没有 `tdjson`）：这是硬约定，否则回放就要账号和网络。"},"895":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"要看运行中的实例、后台跑、优雅停止，见 运行与实例管理。"},"896":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"回放里插件加载失败，多半是 ABI 版本或脚本同伴位置的问题，见 常见问题。"},"897":{"id":"/docs/usage/run","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"page","content":"运行与实例管理","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run"},"898":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run","content":"前台/后台运行、status、stop 与单实例锁"},"899":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"一个目录一个实例"},"900":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"前台运行"},"901":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"后台运行"},"902":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"看状态"},"903":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"停掉"},"904":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"常见情形"},"905":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"实例状态放在 `<项目根>/.fuyubot/` 下的三个文件里，**三件事各占一个文件**："},"906":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件              | 作用                                                                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `.fuyubot/lock` | **只用来独占**（`try_lock`，进程死即释放）。里面不存内容——Windows 的文件锁是强制的，别的进程读不到被锁的字节 |","table":"table-0"},"907":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件                | 作用                                                                             |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `.fuyubot/status` | `key=value`：pid / started / version / plugins / name。**启动完成之后**才发布（拿上锁只说明进程活着） |","table":"table-0"},"908":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件              | 作用                                      |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `.fuyubot/stop` | 停止请求，内容是 PID。`fuyubot stop` 先写它，让实例自己收摊 |","table":"table-0"},"909":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"第二次 `run`（前台后台都算）会被拒，报错里带上在跑的那个 PID。"},"910":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"陈旧的 `lock` **不用手工清理**：拿锁时会顺手删掉上一个实例的 `status` / `stop`。"},"911":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"`--replay` **不占锁、不发布状态**：离线开发路径不该和跑着的实例互斥。"},"912":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"顺序是固定的：自动 init → 拿单实例锁 → 问/读凭据 → attach TDLib → **加载全部插件** → 发 `setTdlibParameters` 并登录 → `getMe` 打印账户 → 发布状态 → 最后才开分发。插件先于登录加载，是为了不漏掉登录窗口里的更新。"},"913":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数              | 作用                     |\n| --------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `--config <路径>` | 配置文件，默认 `fuyubot.toml` |","table":"table-1"},"914":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数                  | 作用         |\n| ------------------- | ---------- |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖配置里的插件目录 |","table":"table-1"},"915":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数           | 作用                                           |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `--no-login` | 只起框架、不走登录流程（CI / 容器；已有 session 仍会被 TDLib 打开） |","table":"table-1"},"916":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数           | 作用             |\n| ------------ | -------------- |\n| `--no-tdlib` | 不接 TDLib，只加载插件 |","table":"table-1"},"917":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数             | 作用    |\n| -------------- | ----- |\n| `--background` | 放到后台跑 |","table":"table-1"},"918":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数                                       | 作用     |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `--replay <JSON>` / `--replay-wait <MS>` | 见 离线回放 |","table":"table-1"},"919":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"凭据来源：`TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH`（Bot Token 还认 `TG_BOT_TOKEN`），缺了才交互式提问。凭据不落盘，详见 环境变量。"},"920":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"它派生一个没有终端的自己，stdout/stderr 追加进 `<目录>logs\\fuyubot.log`；父进程等子进程**真起来**（`.fuyubot/status` 发布）才返回。"},"921":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"后台跑**没有 stdin**。要交互式登录的场合（还没有 session、也没给 `TG_BOT_TOKEN`）会直接失败，并把日志尾巴打出来指路——先用前台 `run` 登一次，session 会落在 `data/`。"},"922":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"`status` 只读 `.fuyubot/`，**不加载插件、不接 TDLib**。三种结果：运行中 / 陈旧（没人在跑，附上次的 pid 与启动时间）/ 没有运行中的实例。还有一种是「有实例在跑、但状态还没发布」，也就是卡在启动里。"},"923":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"`stop` 的机制：写 `.fuyubot/stop` → 实例每 500 ms 看一次 → 停接收循环 → 卸载插件（跑 `plugin_stop`）→ 停内核 → 放锁；**8 秒不理会才硬杀兜底**。硬杀跑不到插件的 `plugin_stop`，所以别一上来就 `taskkill`。"},"924":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"**Ctrl-C 仍是硬杀**：捕获它要开 tokio 的 `signal` feature（会带进 `mio` + `signal-hook-registry` + `errno`，依赖白名单没放行）。要优雅退出就用 `fuyubot stop`，别按 Ctrl-C。"},"925":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象                        | 处理                               |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 重复 `run` 报「已经有实例在跑」，带 PID | 先 `status`，再 `stop`；不要手工删 `lock` |","table":"table-2"},"926":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象           | 处理                        |\n| ------------ | ------------------------- |\n| `status` 说陈旧 | 正常，陈旧状态不用清理，下次 `run` 自己接管 |","table":"table-2"},"927":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象                      | 处理                         |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 后台启动后立刻 `status` 报「启动中」 | 状态是在插件加载 + 登录之后才发布的，等一会儿再看 |","table":"table-2"},"928":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象       | 处理                            |\n| -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 进程活着但没更新 | 没登录就收不到任何更新；先用 `--replay` 验插件 |","table":"table-2"},"929":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting"},"930":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","content":"tdjson 找不到、%TEMP%、乱码、插件加载失败"},"931":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"找不到 tdjson"},"932":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"`LNK1104: cannot open file '...\\Temp\\lnk{GUID}.tmp'`"},"933":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"中文乱码 / 行号错位"},"934":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"插件加载失败"},"935":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#回放以非零码中止","content":"回放以非零码中止"},"936":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"收不到更新 / 进程停不下来"},"937":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"**构建成功不代表运行找得到**：`fuyubot-tdlib` 在编译期不依赖 tdjson 存在。缺库时 `run` 不会崩，而是打一行然后继续跑（插件照样加载，只是收不到更新）："},"938":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"四级查找顺序（不要重排）："},"939":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                   |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 1   | `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` 指向的**文件**或**目录** |","table":"table-0"},"940":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                 |\n| --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 2   | vendored（构建期烤进去的目录）→ **可执行文件所在目录** |","table":"table-0"},"941":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                      |\n| --- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | Linux 带版本号的系统库（`libtdjson.so.1.8.68` …） |","table":"table-0"},"942":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                          |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | 裸库名（`tdjson.dll` / `libtdjson.so`，走 `PATH`） |","table":"table-0"},"943":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"报错里的 `[1]` … `[4]` 就是这四档的逐条结果，按顺序看就知道断在哪。嫌排查麻烦就直接指定："},"944":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"加载动态库时会**先查库自己所在的目录**（Windows 上是 `LOAD_WITH_ALTERED_SEARCH_PATH`）。否则 tdjson 的兄弟依赖（libssl / zlib 之类）找不到，报的却是 `ERROR_MOD_NOT_FOUND`（126）——错误信息说「库不在」，实际缺的是它的依赖。所以 tdjson 和它的兄弟 DLL 要放在一起。"},"945":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"`cargo install` 装出来的二进制是唯一例外：安装目录不受构建脚本管，tdjson 得自己放到它旁边或设 `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH`。"},"946":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"这是 **MSVC 链接器写不了 `%TEMP%`**（受限环境 / 沙箱里常见），跟你的代码无关。把临时目录指到可写的位置："},"947":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"同一坑的另一面：**测试不许依赖 `%TEMP%`**。仓库约定临时目录一律放 `target/test-tmp/<crate>/<名字>`——MSYS（git bash）会把 `TEMP` 改成 `/tmp`（在 Windows 上解析成当前盘根），受限环境里真实 `%TEMP%` 也可能写不了。换个 shell 就红的测试几乎总是这个原因。"},"948":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"本机 PowerShell 的默认代码页是 cp936：`Get-Content` 会把 UTF-8 当 **GBK** 解码，中文注释直接毁掉，还会**吞换行**导致行号错位（按行号删代码会删错）。看文件内容用编辑器或 `read` 工具，别用 shell 的文本通道读写源码。"},"949":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"脚本插件那条链路的 stdio 两侧已经钉成 UTF-8——Windows 上 Python 默认按系统代码页读管道，不钉就会把中文变乱码。这是 SDK 的职责，插件作者不用管。"},"950":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"`run` 遇到加载不了的插件会打一行然后**继续**："},"951":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"`--plugin-dir` 下的东西会被逐个尝试，所以「少加载了一个」不会让整个进程失败——去看这行。"},"952":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                | 原因 / 怎么查                             |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `ABI 版本是 N，宿主是 M` | 插件与宿主的 ABI 不匹配：用同一份 SDK 重新编译，别拿旧产物硬跑 |","table":"table-1"},"953":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                        | 原因 / 怎么查                                              |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 缺 `plugin_init` / 根本不是动态库 | `fuyubot-sdk check <路径>` **静态**看导出符号；非零退出码 = 宿主一定拒绝加载 |","table":"table-1"},"954":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                                           | 原因 / 怎么查                                                                                      |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Node 报 `Cannot find module '...\\counter.ts'` | 脚本同伴不在 cdylib 旁边。用 `plugin install` 装（会连 `.py` / `.js` / `.ts` / `.pyi` 一起拷），或把脚本和 dll 拷进同一目录 |","table":"table-1"},"955":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象              | 原因 / 怎么查                                        |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `.dll` 加载报找不到依赖 | 插件把兄弟 DLL 放自己旁边是支持的（加载器先查库所在目录），别把它挪走，也别只拷主 dll |","table":"table-1"},"956":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"脚本插件还有一条硬约定：`.py` / `.js` / `.ts` 必须和那个 cdylib **同目录**，宿主按「库旁边找脚本」的规则找它。"},"957":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#回放以非零码中止","content":"多半是插件目录里有你不想要的东西：`--plugin-dir` 指向 `target/debug` 会混进所有示例产物，其中脚本插件的脚本不在旁边，加载失败就把回放整个拉停。把要验的插件装进一个干净目录即可。见 离线回放。"},"958":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"| 现象         | 处理                             |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 进程跑着但插件没反应 | 没登录就收不到任何更新。要立刻验插件用 `--replay` |","table":"table-2"},"959":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags"